  ('paldea', 74, 10201, false, '서로의 꼬리를 붙여서 전기를 흐르게 하는 게 피카츄 사이의 인사법이다.', 'Possesses cheek sacs in which it stores electricity. This clever forest-dweller roasts tough berries with an electric shock before consuming them.'),
  ('paldea', 74, 10267, false, '서로의 꼬리를 붙여서 전기를 흐르게 하는 게 피카츄 사이의 인사법이다.', 'Possesses cheek sacs in which it stores electricity. This clever forest-dweller roasts tough berries with an electric shock before consuming them.'),
  ('paldea', 74, 10319, false, '서로의 꼬리를 붙여서 전기를 흐르게 하는 게 피카츄 사이의 인사법이다.', 'Possesses cheek sacs in which it stores electricity. This clever forest-dweller roasts tough berries with an electric shock before consuming them.'),
  ('paldea', 74, 10368, false, '서로의 꼬리를 붙여서 전기를 흐르게 하는 게 피카츄 사이의 인사법이다.', 'Possesses cheek sacs in which it stores electricity. This clever forest-dweller roasts tough berries with an electric shock before consuming them.'),
  ('paldea', 75, 26, true, '전기 주머니가 텅 비면 꼬리를 똑바로 세워서 공기 중의 전기를 모은다.', 'It can discharge bursts of electricity exceeding 100,000 volts— a single strike with that amount of power would incapacitate one of the Copperajah of my homeland.'),
  ('paldea', 75, 10202, false, '전기 주머니가 텅 비면 꼬리를 똑바로 세워서 공기 중의 전기를 모은다.', 'It can discharge bursts of electricity exceeding 100,000 volts— a single strike with that amount of power would incapacitate one of the Copperajah of my homeland.'),
  ('paldea', 76, 926, true, null, 'This Pokémon is smooth and moist to the touch. Yeast in Fidough’s breath induces fermentation in the Pokémon’s vicinity.'),
  ('paldea', 77, 927, true, null, 'The pleasant aroma that emanates from this Pokémon’s body helps wheat grow, so Dachsbun has been treasured by farming villages.'),
  ('paldea', 78, 287, true, '심장의 고동이 1분에 1번 뛴다. 아무튼 가만히 누워 있는 포켓몬으로 움직이는 모습을 거의 볼 수가 없다.', 'Slakoth’s heart beats just once a minute. Whatever happens, it is content to loaf around motionless. It is rare to see this Pokémon in motion.'),
  ('paldea', 79, 288, true, '가만히 있질 못하는 포켓몬이다. 자려고 해도 몸의 피가 끓어올라서 숲 속을 뛰어다니지 않으면 가라앉지 않는다.', 'Vigoroth is simply incapable of remaining still. Even when it tries to sleep, the blood in its veins grows agitated, compelling this Pokémon to run wild throughout the jungle before it can settle down.'),
  ('paldea', 80, 289, true, '초원에 새겨진 반경 1m의 둥근 띠 모양은 게을킹이 누운 채로 주변의 풀을 먹어치워 생긴 것이다.', 'Wherever Slaking live, rings of over a yard in diameter appear in grassy fields. They are made by the Pokémon as it eats all the grass within reach while lying prone on the ground.'),
  ('paldea', 81, 761, true, '습격당할 때 흘리는 땀은 달콤하고 맛있다. 그 향기가 적을 더 늘리고 만다.', 'When under attack, it secretes a sweet and delicious sweat. The scent only calls more enemies to it.'),
  ('paldea', 82, 762, true, '쪼아대는 파크로우를 머리의 꼭지로 후려치고 예리한 발차기를 먹인다.', 'Any Corvisquire that pecks at this Pokémon will be greeted with a smack from its sepals followed by a sharp kick.'),
  ('paldea', 83, 763, true, '단단하고 뾰족한 발끝으로 킥을 먹여서 상대의 몸과 마음에 지워지지 않는 상처를 남긴다.', 'A kick from the hardened tips of this Pokémon’s legs leaves a wound in the opponent’s body and soul that will never heal.'),
  ('paldea', 84, 928, true, null, 'It protects itself from enemies by emitting oil from the fruit on its head. This oil is bitter and astringent enough to make someone flinch.'),
  ('paldea', 85, 929, true, null, 'Dolliv shares its tasty, fresh-scented oil with others. This species has coexisted with humans since times long gone.'),
  ('paldea', 86, 930, true, null, 'This calm Pokémon is very compassionate. It will share its delicious, nutrient-rich oil with weakened Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 87, 438, true, '건조한 바위 밭에 산다. 초록색 구슬은 마를수록 반들반들 희미하게 빛난다.', 'Its tears elicit sympathy from those who see them, but do not be deceived! This expulsion of body water is merely a physiological mechanism for keeping itself in good health.'),
  ('paldea', 88, 185, true, '습격당하지 않도록 나무 흉내를 낸다. 물에 약하기 때문에 비가 내리면 어느 틈에 모습을 감춰버린다.', 'Though it pretends to be a tree, it fails to fool even children. To the touch, its body feels more like rock than tree bark. Sudowoodo''s extreme aversion to water merits special note.'),
  ('paldea', 89, 744, true, '목의 바위를 땅에 세게 부딪쳐서 상대를 위협한다. 풀이 죽은 순간에 덮친다.', 'This Pokémon intimidates opponents by striking the ground with the rocks on its neck. The moment an opponent flinches, Rockruff attacks.'),
  ('paldea', 89, 10310, false, '목의 바위를 땅에 세게 부딪쳐서 상대를 위협한다. 풀이 죽은 순간에 덮친다.', 'This Pokémon intimidates opponents by striking the ground with the rocks on its neck. The moment an opponent flinches, Rockruff attacks.'),
  ('paldea', 90, 745, true, '빠른 움직임으로 먹이를 차츰차츰 궁지에 몰아넣는다. 이빨은 항상 급소를 노리고 있다.', 'With swift movements, this Pokémon gradually backs its prey into a corner. Lycanroc’s fangs are always aimed toward opponents’ weak spots.'),
  ('paldea', 90, 10228, false, '빠른 움직임으로 먹이를 차츰차츰 궁지에 몰아넣는다. 이빨은 항상 급소를 노리고 있다.', 'With swift movements, this Pokémon gradually backs its prey into a corner. Lycanroc’s fangs are always aimed toward opponents’ weak spots.'),
  ('paldea', 90, 10311, false, '빠른 움직임으로 먹이를 차츰차츰 궁지에 몰아넣는다. 이빨은 항상 급소를 노리고 있다.', 'With swift movements, this Pokémon gradually backs its prey into a corner. Lycanroc’s fangs are always aimed toward opponents’ weak spots.'),
  ('paldea', 91, 837, true, '바위투성이의 거친 길을 아무렇지도 않게 일륜차처럼 달린다. 석탄을 태워서 살고 있다.', 'It can race around like a unicycle, even on rough, rocky terrain. Burning coal sustains it.'),
  ('paldea', 92, 838, true, '다리를 고속으로 회전시켜 시속 30km로 달린다. 섭씨 1000도의 불꽃을 내뿜는다.', 'By rapidly rolling its legs, it can travel at over 18 mph. The temperature of the flames it breathes exceeds 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit.'),
  ('paldea', 93, 839, true, '싸우게 되면 석탄으로 된 산이 새빨갛게 타올라 불똥을 흩뿌려 주위를 태운다.', 'While it’s engaged in battle, its mountain of coal will burn bright red, sending off sparks that scorch the surrounding area.'),
  ('paldea', 93, 10384, false, '싸우게 되면 석탄으로 된 산이 새빨갛게 타올라 불똥을 흩뿌려 주위를 태운다.', 'While it’s engaged in battle, its mountain of coal will burn bright red, sending off sparks that scorch the surrounding area.'),
  ('paldea', 94, 403, true, '털이 전기로 빛난다. 밝게 빛나는 꼬리 끝을 흔들어 동료에게 신호를 보낸다.', 'Shakes its body to generate electricity. Its stature belies its aggression—one must be patient to tame this Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 95, 404, true, '적을 만나면 100만 볼트의 위력을 가진 발톱을 드러내어 싸움에 대비한다.', 'Proudly uses its electrified claws as weapons. It seems to be a gracious Pokémon, evenly sharing the spoils of the hunt with others of its kind.'),
  ('paldea', 96, 405, true, '투시는 전기 에너지를 매우 많이 소모하기 때문에 오랜 시간 수면을 취해서 에너지를 비축한다.', 'They form packs, each having one male as leader. Legends say that when Luxray''s two eyes shimmer with gold, the Pokémon can see through anything.'),
  ('paldea', 97, 396, true, '벌레 포켓몬을 노리고 산과 들을 많은 무리로 날아다닌다. 울음소리가 무척 시끄럽다.', 'They live in the fields and mountains, gathering in large flocks. Their cries are quite obnoxious. Though small, their wings are strong—a strike from them leaves pain that persists for a week.'),
  ('paldea', 98, 397, true, '숲이나 초원에 서식한다. 그룹이 마주치면 영역을 건 분쟁이 시작된다.', 'They form remarkably large flocks and are constantly fighting amongst themselves. I suspect that those with magnificent plumes on their heads are the strong ones.'),
  ('paldea', 99, 398, true, '찌르호크가 되면 무리에서 떨어져 혼자서 살아간다. 강인한 날개를 가지고 있다.', 'It has left the flock, having gained strength enough to survive on its own. The astounding force with which Staraptor flies through the air allows it to carry away large, burly targets.'),
  ('paldea', 100, 741, true, '다홍꿀을 빨아들인 춤추새. 트레이너가 틀린 지시를 내리면 격렬하게 화를 내는 격정적인 성격이다.', 'This Oricorio has drunk red nectar. If its Trainer gives the wrong order, this passionate Pokémon becomes fiercely angry.'),
  ('paldea', 100, 10225, false, '다홍꿀을 빨아들인 춤추새. 트레이너가 틀린 지시를 내리면 격렬하게 화를 내는 격정적인 성격이다.', 'This Oricorio has drunk red nectar. If its Trainer gives the wrong order, this passionate Pokémon becomes fiercely angry.'),
  ('paldea', 100, 10226, false, '다홍꿀을 빨아들인 춤추새. 트레이너가 틀린 지시를 내리면 격렬하게 화를 내는 격정적인 성격이다.', 'This Oricorio has drunk red nectar. If its Trainer gives the wrong order, this passionate Pokémon becomes fiercely angry.'),
  ('paldea', 100, 10227, false, '다홍꿀을 빨아들인 춤추새. 트레이너가 틀린 지시를 내리면 격렬하게 화를 내는 격정적인 성격이다.', 'This Oricorio has drunk red nectar. If its Trainer gives the wrong order, this passionate Pokémon becomes fiercely angry.'),
  ('paldea', 101, 179, true, '솜털이 마찰하여 전기가 모인다. 귀엽다고 맨손으로 만지면 따끔하게 저리고 아프다.', 'Rubbing its fleece generates electricity. You’ll want to pet it because it’s cute, but if you use your bare hand, you’ll get a painful shock.'),
  ('paldea', 102, 180, true, '푹신푹신한 털에 전기를 저장한다. 너무 많이 저장해서 여기저기 반질반질하게 털이 빠져 버렸다.', 'It stores electricity in its fluffy fleece. If it stores up too much, it will start to go bald in those patches.'),
  ('paldea', 103, 181, true, '꼬리는 강하고 밝게 빛난다. 뱃사람들의 길잡이로서 옛날부터 소중히 여겨져 왔다.', 'Its tail shines bright and strong. It has been prized since long ago as a beacon for sailors.'),
  ('paldea', 103, 10145, false, '꼬리는 강하고 밝게 빛난다. 뱃사람들의 길잡이로서 옛날부터 소중히 여겨져 왔다.', 'Its tail shines bright and strong. It has been prized since long ago as a beacon for sailors.'),
  ('paldea', 104, 548, true, '잎사귀의 색이 짙을수록 건강하다. 잘 정돈된 밭이나 화단에 자리잡고 살기도 한다.', 'The leaves on its head are highly valued for medicinal purposes. Dry the leaves in the sun, boil them, and then drink the bitter decoction for remarkably effective relief from fatigue.'),
  ('paldea', 105, 549, true, '꽃으로 만든 정유는 최고의 향을 내지만 눈이 튀어나올 정도로 비싸다.', 'I suspect that its well-developed legs are the result of a life spent on mountains covered in deep snow. The scent it exudes from its flower crown heartens those in proximity.'),
  ('paldea', 105, 10406, false, '꽃으로 만든 정유는 최고의 향을 내지만 눈이 튀어나올 정도로 비싸다.', 'I suspect that its well-developed legs are the result of a life spent on mountains covered in deep snow. The scent it exudes from its flower crown heartens those in proximity.'),
  ('paldea', 106, 285, true, '위험을 느끼면 몸을 흔들어 머리의 정수리에서 포자를 뿌린다. 풀과 나무가 시들 정도의 맹독이다.', 'If Shroomish senses danger, it shakes its body and scatters spores from the top of its head. This Pokémon’s spores are so toxic, they make trees and weeds wilt.'),
  ('paldea', 107, 286, true, '꼬리의 씨앗은 독 포자가 굳어져 생긴 것이라 먹으면 큰일 난다. 한 입만 먹어도 배 속에서 부글부글 소리가 난다.', 'The seeds ringing Breloom’s tail are made of hardened toxic spores. It is horrible to eat the seeds. Just taking a bite of this Pokémon’s seed will cause your stomach to rumble.'),
  ('paldea', 108, 840, true, '태어나면 사과 안으로 숨어든다. 안을 파먹으면서 성장하고 사과 맛이 진화를 결정한다.', 'As soon as it’s born, it burrows into an apple. Not only does the apple serve as its food source, but the flavor of the fruit determines its evolution.'),
  ('paldea', 109, 841, true, '사과 껍질로 된 날개로 날며 강산성의 타액을 뱉는다. 사과의 형태로 변형한다.', 'It flies on wings of apple skin and spits a powerful acid. It can also change its shape into that of an apple.'),
  ('paldea', 109, 10385, false, '사과 껍질로 된 날개로 날며 강산성의 타액을 뱉는다. 사과의 형태로 변형한다.', 'It flies on wings of apple skin and spits a powerful acid. It can also change its shape into that of an apple.'),
  ('paldea', 110, 842, true, '달콤한 꿀로 몸이 둘러싸여 있다. 등의 껍질은 특히 더 달콤해서 옛날에는 어린이 간식이었다.', 'Its body is covered in sweet nectar, and the skin on its back is especially yummy. Children used to have it as a snack.'),
  ('paldea', 110, 10386, false, '달콤한 꿀로 몸이 둘러싸여 있다. 등의 껍질은 특히 더 달콤해서 옛날에는 어린이 간식이었다.', 'Its body is covered in sweet nectar, and the skin on its back is especially yummy. Children used to have it as a snack.'),
  ('paldea', 111, 325, true, '머리에 얹은 진주가 피그점프의 사이코 파워를 높여주는 역할을 한다. 항상 큰 진주를 찾고 있다.', 'Spoink keeps a pearl on top of its head. The pearl functions to amplify this Pokémon’s psychokinetic powers. It is therefore on a constant search for a bigger pearl.'),
  ('paldea', 112, 326, true, '흑진주를 이용하여 이상한 힘을 사용할 때 기묘한 스텝으로 춤을 춘다. 흑진주는 미술품으로서의 가치를 지녔다.', 'Grumpig uses the black pearls on its body to wield its fantastic powers. When it is doing so, it dances bizarrely. This Pokémon’s black pearls are valuable as works of art.'),
  ('paldea', 113, 931, true, null, 'These Pokémon prefer to live in cities. They form flocks based on the color of their feathers, and they fight over territory.'),
  ('paldea', 113, 10429, false, null, 'These Pokémon prefer to live in cities. They form flocks based on the color of their feathers, and they fight over territory.'),
  ('paldea', 113, 10430, false, null, 'These Pokémon prefer to live in cities. They form flocks based on the color of their feathers, and they fight over territory.'),
  ('paldea', 113, 10431, false, null, 'These Pokémon prefer to live in cities. They form flocks based on the color of their feathers, and they fight over territory.'),
  ('paldea', 114, 200, true, '사람이 울부짖는 소리를 흉내 내 모두를 겁주고 기뻐한다. 담력이 강한 상대는 좋아하지 않는다.', 'It conceals itself in darkness, sending chills up travelers'' spines with its childlike weeping. As it observes the frightened travelers with glee, the red orbs upon its chest let off an eerie light.'),
  ('paldea', 115, 429, true, '저주의 말을 중얼거리며 심한 두통이나 무서운 환상을 보여 줘서 괴롭힌다.', 'The incantations Mismagius chants can ward against misfortune, so a custom exists of inviting it into one''s home. Incur the Pokémon''s displeasure, however, and disaster will surely ensue.'),
  ('paldea', 116, 296, true, '강한 마크탕을 키우기 위해 트레이너들이 전통적으로 만드는 전골 요리가 있다고 한다.', 'There’s a rumor of a traditional recipe for stew that Trainers can use to raise strong Makuhita.'),
  ('paldea', 117, 297, true, '뚱뚱하고 큰 하리뭉이 다 강한 것은 아니다. 작지만 몸이 가볍고 기술이 뛰어난 하리뭉도 있다.', 'Hariyama that are big and fat aren’t necessarily strong. There are some small ones that move nimbly and use moves skillfully.'),
  ('paldea', 118, 739, true, '야자나무로 착각하고 나시에 오르는 일도 있다. 분노를 사 내동댕이쳐진 다음 짓밟힌다.', 'Crabrawler has been known to mistake Exeggutor for a coconut tree and climb it. The enraged Exeggutor shakes it off and stomps it.'),
  ('paldea', 119, 740, true, '생각하기보다는 일단 때리고 본다. 눈사태를 펀치 러시로 되받아쳤다는 기록도 있다.', 'Before it stops to think, it just starts pummeling. There are records of its turning back avalanches with a flurry of punches.'),
  ('paldea', 120, 757, true, '먹이의 뒤로 숨어들어서 눈치채기 전에 독가스를 퍼부어 움직이지 못하게 한다.', 'This sneaky Pokémon will slink behind its prey and immobilize it with poisonous gas before the prey even realizes Salandit is there.'),
  ('paldea', 121, 758, true, '염뉴트들의 싸움은 거느리고 있는 수컷 야도뇽의 수로 승패가 정해지는 듯하다.', 'The winner of competitions between Salazzle is decided by which one has the most male Salandit with it.'),
  ('paldea', 122, 231, true, '긴 코를 써서 물을 끼얹는다. 동료가 모여들면 서로 물을 끼얹는다. 흠뻑 젖은 몸을 물가에서 말린다.', 'Phanpy uses its long nose to shower itself. When others gather around, they thoroughly douse each other with water. These Pokémon can be seen drying their soaking-wet bodies at the edge of water.'),
  ('paldea', 123, 232, true, '단단한 몸으로 부딪치면 집도 부서진다. 그 힘을 이용해 산길을 막고 있는 토사를 치우는 일을 돕는다.', 'If Donphan were to tackle with its hard body, even a house could be destroyed. Using its massive strength, the Pokémon helps clear rock and mud slides that block mountain trails.'),
  ('paldea', 124, 878, true, '힘쓰는 일에 강하다. 동으로 된 몸체는 비에 녹슬어 선명한 녹색으로 변한다.', 'If a job requires serious strength, this Pokémon will excel at it. Its copper body tarnishes in the rain, turning a vibrant green color.'),
  ('paldea', 125, 879, true, '무리를 지어 생활한다. 코의 악력은 큰 바위도 산산이 부술 정도로 강하다.', 'These Pokémon live in herds. Their trunks have incredible grip strength, strong enough to crush giant rocks into powder.'),
  ('paldea', 125, 10393, false, '무리를 지어 생활한다. 코의 악력은 큰 바위도 산산이 부술 정도로 강하다.', 'These Pokémon live in herds. Their trunks have incredible grip strength, strong enough to crush giant rocks into powder.'),
  ('paldea', 126, 443, true, '움직이는 것은 무조건 공격해서 보금자리 굴로 데려간다. 입은 크지만 위는 작은 편이다.', 'It nests in caves untouched by sunlight. Its sharp teeth may fall out when worn away or after an impact, but they regrow within a few days.'),
  ('paldea', 127, 444, true, '거처인 동굴에 보석을 매장하는데 그곳에 침입자가 들어가면 즉시 발톱과 이빨로 갈기갈기 찢어버린다.', 'Though Gabite are usually of a violent disposition, when I gave one a glass bead it had been eyeing covetously, it suddenly became quite docile.'),
  ('paldea', 128, 445, true, '지상에서도 움직임이 빠르다. 설산에서는 체온이 떨어지기 전에 먹이를 잡아 거처로 돌아간다.', 'Soars across the heavens at blinding speed—a magnificent sight! It has a feral disposition. Utmost caution is required if one meets a Garchomp out in the wilds.'),
  ('paldea', 128, 10158, false, '지상에서도 움직임이 빠르다. 설산에서는 체온이 떨어지기 전에 먹이를 잡아 거처로 돌아간다.', 'Soars across the heavens at blinding speed—a magnificent sight! It has a feral disposition. Utmost caution is required if one meets a Garchomp out in the wilds.'),
  ('paldea', 129, 932, true, null, 'It was born in a layer of rock salt deep under the earth. This species was particularly treasured in the old days, as they would share precious salt.'),
  ('paldea', 130, 933, true, null, 'This Pokémon dry cures its prey by spraying salt over them. The curing process steals away the water in the prey’s body.'),
  ('paldea', 131, 934, true, null, 'Garganacl will rub its fingertips together and sprinkle injured Pokémon with salt. Even severe wounds will promptly heal afterward.'),
  ('paldea', 132, 278, true, '공기의 흐름을 이용하여 날갯짓하지 않고 하늘로 날아오른다. 해변의 절벽에 둥지를 만든다.', 'It soars on updrafts without flapping its wings. It makes a nest on sheer cliffs at the sea’s edge.'),
  ('paldea', 133, 279, true, '해면 아주 가까이 날아 큰 부리로 해수와 함께 먹이를 건져 나른다.', 'Skimming the water’s surface, it dips its large bill in the sea, scoops up food and water, and carries it.'),
  ('paldea', 134, 129, true, '유속이 빠른 곳에서는 그저 떠내려갈 뿐인 약하고 한심한 포켓몬이다.', 'A feeble, pitiful imbecile of a Pokémon that is nonetheless very hardy. Unperturbed by turbid water, it can be found living in all sorts of places.'),
  ('paldea', 135, 130, true, '한번 난동부리기 시작한 갸라도스는 태풍이 사납게 휘몰아쳐도 모든 것을 다 태워버린다.', 'I suspect this Pokémon to be the true identity of a dragon written of in ancient texts, which claimed that it razed an entire village with white-hot beams from its maw.'),
  ('paldea', 135, 10141, false, '한번 난동부리기 시작한 갸라도스는 태풍이 사납게 휘몰아쳐도 모든 것을 다 태워버린다.', 'I suspect this Pokémon to be the true identity of a dragon written of in ancient texts, which claimed that it razed an entire village with white-hot beams from its maw.'),
  ('paldea', 136, 846, true, '배가 불러서 현저히 움직임이 둔해지면 윽우지가 통째로 삼켜버린다.', 'After it’s eaten its fill, its movements become extremely sluggish. That’s when Cramorant swallows it up.'),
  ('paldea', 137, 847, true, '꼬리지느러미를 회전시켜 단번에 돌격한다. 100노트를 넘는 속도로 먹이를 관통한다.', 'It spins its tail fins to propel itself, surging forward at speeds of over 100 knots before ramming prey and spearing into them.'),
  ('paldea', 138, 550, true, '옛날에는 식탁에 올랐다. 적색근 배쓰나이의 살코기는 기름이 많아 젊은 층이 좋아한다.', 'Though it differs from other Basculin in several respects, including demeanor—this one is gentle—I have categorized it as a regional form given the vast array of shared qualities.'),
  ('paldea', 138, 10066, false, '옛날에는 식탁에 올랐다. 적색근 배쓰나이의 살코기는 기름이 많아 젊은 층이 좋아한다.', 'Though it differs from other Basculin in several respects, including demeanor—this one is gentle—I have categorized it as a regional form given the vast array of shared qualities.'),
  ('paldea', 138, 10416, false, '옛날에는 식탁에 올랐다. 적색근 배쓰나이의 살코기는 기름이 많아 젊은 층이 좋아한다.', 'Though it differs from other Basculin in several respects, including demeanor—this one is gentle—I have categorized it as a regional form given the vast array of shared qualities.'),
  ('paldea', 139, 316, true, '몸 대부분이 위로 되어 있어 심장이나 뇌는 매우 작다. 무엇이든 녹이는 특수한 위액을 지녔다.', 'Most of Gulpin’s body is made up of its stomach—its heart and brain are very small in comparison. This Pokémon’s stomach contains special enzymes that dissolve anything.'),
  ('paldea', 140, 317, true, '이빨이 하나도 없어서 무엇이든 통째로 삼킨다. 최대한 벌린 입은 정말 커서 자동차 타이어마저도 쑥 들어간다.', 'Swalot has no teeth, so what it eats, it swallows whole, no matter what. Its cavernous mouth yawns widely. An automobile tire could easily fit inside this Pokémon’s mouth.'),
  ('paldea', 141, 52, true, '이마의 금화가 더러워지지 않도록 바지런히 얼굴을 씻는다. 가라르의 나옹과는 사이가 나쁘다.', 'It washes its face regularly to keep the coin on its forehead spotless. It doesn’t get along with Galarian Meowth.'),
  ('paldea', 141, 10209, false, '이마의 금화가 더러워지지 않도록 바지런히 얼굴을 씻는다. 가라르의 나옹과는 사이가 나쁘다.', 'It washes its face regularly to keep the coin on its forehead spotless. It doesn’t get along with Galarian Meowth.'),
  ('paldea', 141, 10320, false, '이마의 금화가 더러워지지 않도록 바지런히 얼굴을 씻는다. 가라르의 나옹과는 사이가 나쁘다.', 'It washes its face regularly to keep the coin on its forehead spotless. It doesn’t get along with Galarian Meowth.'),
  ('paldea', 141, 10369, false, '이마의 금화가 더러워지지 않도록 바지런히 얼굴을 씻는다. 가라르의 나옹과는 사이가 나쁘다.', 'It washes its face regularly to keep the coin on its forehead spotless. It doesn’t get along with Galarian Meowth.'),
  ('paldea', 142, 53, true, '움직임은 우아하고 품위 있다. 야만스러운 나이킹과는 잘 맞지 않아 서로를 멸시한다.', 'Its elegant and refined behavior clashes with that of the barbaric Perrserker. The relationship between the two is one of mutual disdain.'),
  ('paldea', 142, 10210, false, '움직임은 우아하고 품위 있다. 야만스러운 나이킹과는 잘 맞지 않아 서로를 멸시한다.', 'Its elegant and refined behavior clashes with that of the barbaric Perrserker. The relationship between the two is one of mutual disdain.'),
  ('paldea', 143, 425, true, '영혼들이 모여 탄생했다. 습기가 많은 계절에는 대량으로 나타나기도 한다.', 'Said to lure away young children and carry them off to the afterlife. Some whisper that Drifloon are formed of reincarnated human souls, but these rumors are as yet unconfirmed.'),
  ('paldea', 144, 426, true, '사람과 포켓몬을 붙잡아 그대로 어딘가로 운반한다. 행선지는 아무도 모른다.', 'It drifts along at dusk, perfectly silent. Its transient, melancholy aspect touches some people deeply—every so often, one will come upon a song or poem devoted to Drifblim.'),
  ('paldea', 145, 669, true, '머리의 관은 꽃가루를 모아서 만든 것이다. 치유의 효과가 숨겨져 있다.', 'Flabébé wears a crown made from pollen it’s collected from its flower. The crown has hidden healing properties.'),
  ('paldea', 145, 10103, false, '머리의 관은 꽃가루를 모아서 만든 것이다. 치유의 효과가 숨겨져 있다.', 'Flabébé wears a crown made from pollen it’s collected from its flower. The crown has hidden healing properties.'),
  ('paldea', 145, 10104, false, '머리의 관은 꽃가루를 모아서 만든 것이다. 치유의 효과가 숨겨져 있다.', 'Flabébé wears a crown made from pollen it’s collected from its flower. The crown has hidden healing properties.'),
  ('paldea', 145, 10105, false, '머리의 관은 꽃가루를 모아서 만든 것이다. 치유의 효과가 숨겨져 있다.', 'Flabébé wears a crown made from pollen it’s collected from its flower. The crown has hidden healing properties.'),
  ('paldea', 145, 10106, false, '머리의 관은 꽃가루를 모아서 만든 것이다. 치유의 효과가 숨겨져 있다.', 'Flabébé wears a crown made from pollen it’s collected from its flower. The crown has hidden healing properties.'),
  ('paldea', 146, 670, true, '자신의 파워를 꽃에 주고 진심을 담아 돌본다. 화단을 어지럽히는 자는 용서하지 않는다.', 'It gives its own power to flowers, pouring its heart into caring for them. Floette never forgives anyone who messes up a flower bed.'),
  ('paldea', 146, 10107, false, '자신의 파워를 꽃에 주고 진심을 담아 돌본다. 화단을 어지럽히는 자는 용서하지 않는다.', 'It gives its own power to flowers, pouring its heart into caring for them. Floette never forgives anyone who messes up a flower bed.'),
  ('paldea', 146, 10108, false, '자신의 파워를 꽃에 주고 진심을 담아 돌본다. 화단을 어지럽히는 자는 용서하지 않는다.', 'It gives its own power to flowers, pouring its heart into caring for them. Floette never forgives anyone who messes up a flower bed.'),
  ('paldea', 146, 10109, false, '자신의 파워를 꽃에 주고 진심을 담아 돌본다. 화단을 어지럽히는 자는 용서하지 않는다.', 'It gives its own power to flowers, pouring its heart into caring for them. Floette never forgives anyone who messes up a flower bed.'),
  ('paldea', 146, 10110, false, '자신의 파워를 꽃에 주고 진심을 담아 돌본다. 화단을 어지럽히는 자는 용서하지 않는다.', 'It gives its own power to flowers, pouring its heart into caring for them. Floette never forgives anyone who messes up a flower bed.'),
  ('paldea', 146, 10163, false, '자신의 파워를 꽃에 주고 진심을 담아 돌본다. 화단을 어지럽히는 자는 용서하지 않는다.', 'It gives its own power to flowers, pouring its heart into caring for them. Floette never forgives anyone who messes up a flower bed.'),
  ('paldea', 147, 671, true, '수백 년의 수명을 가졌다. 정원을 지키는 일에 일생을 바친다고 한다.', 'Its life can span several hundred years. It’s said to devote its entire life to protecting gardens.'),
  ('paldea', 147, 10111, false, '수백 년의 수명을 가졌다. 정원을 지키는 일에 일생을 바친다고 한다.', 'Its life can span several hundred years. It’s said to devote its entire life to protecting gardens.'),
  ('paldea', 147, 10112, false, '수백 년의 수명을 가졌다. 정원을 지키는 일에 일생을 바친다고 한다.', 'Its life can span several hundred years. It’s said to devote its entire life to protecting gardens.'),
  ('paldea', 147, 10113, false, '수백 년의 수명을 가졌다. 정원을 지키는 일에 일생을 바친다고 한다.', 'Its life can span several hundred years. It’s said to devote its entire life to protecting gardens.'),
  ('paldea', 147, 10114, false, '수백 년의 수명을 가졌다. 정원을 지키는 일에 일생을 바친다고 한다.', 'Its life can span several hundred years. It’s said to devote its entire life to protecting gardens.'),
  ('paldea', 148, 50, true, '얕은 땅속을 이동한다. 굴을 파며 다닌 곳은 지면이 솟아 있기 때문에 바로 알 수 있다.', 'It burrows through the ground at a shallow depth. It leaves raised earth in its wake, making it easy to spot.'),
  ('paldea', 148, 10207, false, '얕은 땅속을 이동한다. 굴을 파며 다닌 곳은 지면이 솟아 있기 때문에 바로 알 수 있다.', 'It burrows through the ground at a shallow depth. It leaves raised earth in its wake, making it easy to spot.'),
  ('paldea', 149, 51, true, '지하 100km까지 파고들 수 있는 파워를 간직한 세쌍둥이 디그다. 땅 밑은 아무도 모른다.', 'These Diglett triplets dig over 60 miles below sea level. No one knows what it’s like underground.'),
  ('paldea', 149, 10208, false, '지하 100km까지 파고들 수 있는 파워를 간직한 세쌍둥이 디그다. 땅 밑은 아무도 모른다.', 'These Diglett triplets dig over 60 miles below sea level. No one knows what it’s like underground.'),
  ('paldea', 150, 324, true, '사용할 수 없게 된 탄광에는 많은 코터스가 살며 석탄을 부지런히 캐고 있다.', 'You find abandoned coal mines full of them. They dig tirelessly in search of coal.'),
  ('paldea', 151, 322, true, '1200도의 마그마를 몸에 저장하고 있다. 물에 젖으면 마그마가 식어서 덩어리져 무거워지므로 움직임이 둔해진다.', 'Numel stores magma of almost 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit within its body. If it gets wet, the magma cools and hardens. In that event, the Pokémon’s body grows heavy and its movements become sluggish.'),
  ('paldea', 152, 323, true, '등의 혹은 뼈가 변형된 것이다. 펄펄 끓는 마그마를 가끔 뿜어 올린다. 화났을 때 자주 분화하는 것 같다.', 'The humps on Camerupt’s back are formed by a transformation of its bones. They sometimes blast out molten magma. This Pokémon apparently erupts often when it is enraged.'),
  ('paldea', 152, 10189, false, '등의 혹은 뼈가 변형된 것이다. 펄펄 끓는 마그마를 가끔 뿜어 올린다. 화났을 때 자주 분화하는 것 같다.', 'The humps on Camerupt’s back are formed by a transformation of its bones. They sometimes blast out molten magma. This Pokémon apparently erupts often when it is enraged.'),
  ('paldea', 153, 436, true, '닦으면 빛이 나며 진실을 비춘다고 전해지지만 동미러는 닦이는 걸 매우 싫어한다.', 'Floats using a mysterious energy. The pattern engraved upon its back is held as sacred and can sometimes be found in imagery from ancient cemeteries and other such timeworn places.'),
  ('paldea', 154, 437, true, '몸의 무늬 때문에 본래 가라르에는 없던 포켓몬이라고 생각하는 학자도 많다.', 'Some believe that its bell-like cry opens holes to another world. It has been revered as a deity since ancient times.'),
  ('paldea', 155, 610, true, '커다란 어금니를 부딪치며 동료와 장난친다. 어금니는 부러져도 바로 자라나서 걱정 없다.', 'They play with each other by knocking their large tusks together. Their tusks break sometimes, but they grow back so quickly that it isn’t a concern.'),
  ('paldea', 156, 611, true, '갑옷처럼 딱딱한 피부를 가졌다. 몸통박치기와 동시에 어금니로 찌르는 전법이 특기다.', 'Its skin is as hard as a suit of armor. Fraxure’s favorite strategy is to tackle its opponents, stabbing them with its tusks at the same time.'),
  ('paldea', 157, 612, true, '온화한 성격이지만 화가 나면 무섭다. 철골도 베어 가르는 튼튼한 어금니를 보여 줄 것이다.', 'While usually kindhearted, it can be terrifying if angered. Tusks that can slice through steel beams are how Haxorus deals with its adversaries.'),
  ('paldea', 158, 56, true, '몸이 가벼워 나무 위에서 생활한다. 사소한 일로 기분이 나빠져 주변에 있는 것에 덤벼든다.', 'An agile Pokémon that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything.'),
  ('paldea', 159, 57, true, '주위에 아무도 없을 때만은 화를 내지 않고 있다. 그러나 그 모습을 보기가 어렵다.', 'It stops being angry only when nobody else is around. To view this moment is very difficult.'),
  ('paldea', 160, 979, true, null, 'When its anger rose beyond a critical point, this Pokémon gained power that is unfettered by the limits of its physical body.'),
  ('paldea', 161, 307, true, '명상으로 정신 에너지를 높이고 있다. 하루에 나무열매를 한 개만 먹는다. 별로 먹지 않는 것도 수행의 하나다.', 'Meditite heightens its inner energy through meditation. It survives on just one berry a day. Minimal eating is another aspect of this Pokémon’s training.'),
  ('paldea', 162, 308, true, '요가의 힘으로 제6의 감각이 발달하여 사이코 파워를 다룰 수 있게 되었다. 1개월간 아무것도 먹지 않고 명상한다.', 'Through the power of meditation, Medicham developed its sixth sense. It gained the ability to use psychokinetic powers. This Pokémon is known to meditate for a whole month without eating.'),
  ('paldea', 162, 10154, false, '요가의 힘으로 제6의 감각이 발달하여 사이코 파워를 다룰 수 있게 되었다. 1개월간 아무것도 먹지 않고 명상한다.', 'Through the power of meditation, Medicham developed its sixth sense. It gained the ability to use psychokinetic powers. This Pokémon is known to meditate for a whole month without eating.'),
  ('paldea', 163, 447, true, '상대의 감정뿐만 아니라 자연의 상태도 파동이라는 파장의 형태로 느낀다.', 'Though infantile in appearance, it has the mysterious ability to read the minds of humans. The pure of heart are met with Riolu''s approval, while those of ill nature earn only its loathing.'),
  ('paldea', 164, 448, true, '사람이 생각하는 것도 알 수 있기 때문에 정직한 마음을 가진 트레이너만 따른다.', 'A most gallant-looking creature. It emits energy waves and controls them with precision, using them to sense even faraway beings. I have given the name ”aura” to this power.'),
  ('paldea', 164, 10159, false, '사람이 생각하는 것도 알 수 있기 때문에 정직한 마음을 가진 트레이너만 따른다.', 'A most gallant-looking creature. It emits energy waves and controls them with precision, using them to sense even faraway beings. I have given the name ”aura” to this power.'),
  ('paldea', 165, 935, true, null, 'Burnt charcoal came to life and became a Pokémon. Possessing a fiery fighting spirit, Charcadet will battle even tough opponents.'),
  ('paldea', 166, 936, true, null, 'Armarouge evolved through the use of a set of armor that belonged to a distinguished warrior. This Pokémon is incredibly loyal.'),
  ('paldea', 167, 937, true, null, 'The fiery blades on its arms burn fiercely with the lingering resentment of a sword wielder who fell before accomplishing their goal.'),
  ('paldea', 168, 339, true, '2개의 긴 수염으로 탁한 강바닥을 더듬는다. 미끈미끈한 점막으로 몸을 보호한다.', 'Makes its home in swamps with murky water. The poor visibility hides this Pokémon from predators, and the slime on its body makes grasping it difficult.'),
  ('paldea', 169, 340, true, '큰 늪을 영역으로 한다. 적이 가까이 오면 크게 난동부려서 큰 지진을 일으킨다.', 'Strikes its caudal fin against the swamp bed to shake the ground and startle its prey. It will then swallow the fleeing prey whole. People mistook this behavior as the cause of earthquakes.'),
  ('paldea', 170, 938, true, null, 'Tadbulb shakes its tail to generate electricity. If it senses danger, it will make its head blink on and off to alert its allies.'),
  ('paldea', 171, 939, true, null, 'When this Pokémon expands and contracts its wobbly body, the belly-button dynamo in its stomach produces a huge amount of electricity.'),
  ('paldea', 172, 704, true, '뿔은 뛰어난 감각 기관이다. 적의 기척을 느끼면 바로 숨어들어 살아남아 왔다.', 'Goomy hides away in the shade of trees, where it''s nice and humid. If the slime coating its body dries out, the Pokémon instantly becomes lethargic.'),
  ('paldea', 173, 705, true, '등의 돌기 안에 작은 뇌가 있다. 먹이에 대한 생각과 적으로부터 도망치는 생각만 한다.', 'A creature given to melancholy. I suspect its metallic shell developed as a result of the mucus on its skin reacting with the iron in Hisui''s water.'),
  ('paldea', 173, 10410, false, '등의 돌기 안에 작은 뇌가 있다. 먹이에 대한 생각과 적으로부터 도망치는 생각만 한다.', 'A creature given to melancholy. I suspect its metallic shell developed as a result of the mucus on its skin reacting with the iron in Hisui''s water.'),
  ('paldea', 174, 706, true, '긴 뿔을 기세 좋게 늘여서 공격한다. 위력은 헤비급 복서 펀치의 100배다.', 'Able to freely control the hardness of its metallic shell. It loathes solitude and is extremely clingy—it will fume and run riot if those dearest to it ever leave its side.'),
  ('paldea', 174, 10411, false, '긴 뿔을 기세 좋게 늘여서 공격한다. 위력은 헤비급 복서 펀치의 100배다.', 'Able to freely control the hardness of its metallic shell. It loathes solitude and is extremely clingy—it will fume and run riot if those dearest to it ever leave its side.'),
  ('paldea', 175, 453, true, '독을 희석하면 약이 된다. 제약 회사의 마스코트가 된 후로 인기가 많아졌다.', 'A poison wielder with a dastardly personality. Despite such qualities, this species is afforded a measure of popularity due to its peculiar cry and comical features.'),
  ('paldea', 176, 454, true, '사냥감을 처리하면 개굴개굴하며 승리를 자축하는 소리를 높인다. 두빅굴과 가까운 종이다.', 'Its crimson claws contain a virulent toxin. This toxin can be made into a tonic by diluting it, mixing it with several types of wild grass, and boiling it down over two days.'),
  ('paldea', 177, 940, true, null, 'When its wings catch the wind, the bones within produce electricity. This Pokémon dives into the ocean, catching prey by electrocuting them.'),
  ('paldea', 178, 941, true, null, 'Kilowattrel inflates its throat sac to amplify its electricity. By riding the wind, this Pokémon can fly over 430 miles in a day.'),
  ('paldea', 179, 133, true, '불안정한 유전자 덕분에 여러 가지 진화의 가능성을 가지고 있는 특수한 포켓몬.', 'Harbors the potential to evolve into manifold forms. Within Eevee lies the key to the mysteries of Pokémon evolution—I''m certain of it.'),
  ('paldea', 179, 10374, false, '불안정한 유전자 덕분에 여러 가지 진화의 가능성을 가지고 있는 특수한 포켓몬.', 'Harbors the potential to evolve into manifold forms. Within Eevee lies the key to the mysteries of Pokémon evolution—I''m certain of it.'),
  ('paldea', 180, 134, true, '몸의 세포 구조가 물 분자와 닮았다. 물에 녹으면 보이지 않는다.', 'Tests show that its cells closely resemble water molecules, which perhaps explains its ability to conceal its form while submerged. I believe the origins of mermaid folklore lie with this Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 181, 135, true, '공기 중의 마이너스 이온을 빨아들여 약 10000볼트의 전기를 내뱉을 수 있다.', 'Bristles its fur into sharp, needlelike points when enraged. One can hear electricity crackle in its breath when it exhales.'),
  ('paldea', 182, 136, true, '들이마신 공기 중 일부는 체내의 불꽃 주머니로 보내져 1700도의 불꽃이 된다.', 'Flames burn within a saclike organ inside this Pokémon. When Flareon inhales, these flames grow in intensity, reaching a mighty 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit.'),
  ('paldea', 183, 196, true, '이마의 구슬에서 사이코 파워를 방사해서 싸운다. 파워가 다하면 구슬의 색이 흐려진다.', 'Wields an arcane power with which it can predict the weather and even people''s thoughts. When bathed in sunshine, the scarlet orb on its brow glows and builds energy.'),
  ('paldea', 184, 197, true, '보름달이 뜬 밤이나 흥분했을 때 전신의 고리 무늬가 노랗게 빛난다.', 'It is most active in the wee hours of the night, when moonlight bathes the land. Its large eyes can pierce the darkness and perceive prey with absolute clarity.'),
  ('paldea', 185, 470, true, '꼬리는 날카로운 칼날 같다. 큰 나무도 두 동강 내는 탁월한 예리함을 자랑한다.', 'Cells similar to those of plants have been found in its fur. Its hard tail can fell a large tree with one stroke, and the tail''s sharpness exceeds even that of a sword crafted by a master.'),
  ('paldea', 186, 471, true, '글레이시아가 발산하는 냉기는 가루눈을 만들어 내기 때문에 스키장에서 인기가 높다.', 'Glaceon is able to lower its body temperature very quickly. It freezes the atmosphere, creating diamond dust that glitters like gems while it flutters and dances around.'),
  ('paldea', 187, 700, true, '무서운 드래곤포켓몬을 아름다운 님피아가 퇴치하는 동화가 가라르지방에 남아 있다.', 'It emits a soothing aura from its ribbon-shaped organs. It wraps these appendages around quarrelers to instantly restore calm to the situation.'),
  ('paldea', 188, 206, true, '미로 같은 굴에 산다. 흙냄새로 자신이 있는 곳을 알 수 있어 절대 길을 잃지 않는다.', 'The nests Dunsparce live in are mazes of tunnels. They never get lost in their own nests—they can tell where they are by the scent of the dirt.'),
  ('paldea', 189, 982, true, null, 'This Pokémon uses its hard tail to make its nest by boring holes into bedrock deep underground. The nest can reach lengths of over six miles.'),
  ('paldea', 189, 10424, false, null, 'This Pokémon uses its hard tail to make its nest by boring holes into bedrock deep underground. The nest can reach lengths of over six miles.'),
  ('paldea', 190, 585, true, '계절이 바뀌는 시기가 되면 털과 냄새가 변화한다. 계절을 알리는 포켓몬이다.', 'The turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon’s fur. People use it to mark the seasons.'),
  ('paldea', 190, 10068, false, '계절이 바뀌는 시기가 되면 털과 냄새가 변화한다. 계절을 알리는 포켓몬이다.', 'The turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon’s fur. People use it to mark the seasons.'),
  ('paldea', 190, 10069, false, '계절이 바뀌는 시기가 되면 털과 냄새가 변화한다. 계절을 알리는 포켓몬이다.', 'The turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon’s fur. People use it to mark the seasons.'),
  ('paldea', 190, 10070, false, '계절이 바뀌는 시기가 되면 털과 냄새가 변화한다. 계절을 알리는 포켓몬이다.', 'The turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon’s fur. People use it to mark the seasons.'),
  ('paldea', 191, 586, true, '계절의 변화와 함께 거처를 바꾸기에 바라철록이 봄을 나른다고 말하는 사람도 있다.', 'They migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring.'),
  ('paldea', 191, 10071, false, '계절의 변화와 함께 거처를 바꾸기에 바라철록이 봄을 나른다고 말하는 사람도 있다.', 'They migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring.'),
  ('paldea', 191, 10072, false, '계절의 변화와 함께 거처를 바꾸기에 바라철록이 봄을 나른다고 말하는 사람도 있다.', 'They migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring.'),
  ('paldea', 191, 10073, false, '계절의 변화와 함께 거처를 바꾸기에 바라철록이 봄을 나른다고 말하는 사람도 있다.', 'They migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring.'),
  ('paldea', 192, 203, true, '꼬리의 뇌는 생각을 할 수 없을 정도로 작지만 자지 않아도 괜찮아서 24시간 주변을 계속 망보고 있다.', 'Girafarig’s rear head contains a tiny brain that is too small for thinking. However, the rear head doesn’t need to sleep, so it can keep watch over its surroundings 24 hours a day.'),
  ('paldea', 193, 981, true, null, 'Now that the brain waves from the head and tail are synced up, the psychic power of this Pokémon is 10 times stronger than Girafarig’s.'),
  ('paldea', 194, 88, true, '진흙이 뭉쳐져서 태어났다. 악취 때문에 건드릴 엄두가 안 나고 지나간 자리에는 풀 한 포기 나지 않는다.', 'Made of congealed sludge. It smells too putrid to touch. Even weeds won’t grow in its path.'),
  ('paldea', 194, 10214, false, '진흙이 뭉쳐져서 태어났다. 악취 때문에 건드릴 엄두가 안 나고 지나간 자리에는 풀 한 포기 나지 않는다.', 'Made of congealed sludge. It smells too putrid to touch. Even weeds won’t grow in its path.'),
  ('paldea', 195, 89, true, '악취가 심하다! 기절할 정도로 강렬하지만 질뻐기는 코가 퇴화해서 냄새를 맡지 못한다.', 'Smells so awful, it can cause fainting. Through degeneration of its nose, it lost its sense of smell.'),
  ('paldea', 195, 10215, false, '악취가 심하다! 기절할 정도로 강렬하지만 질뻐기는 코가 퇴화해서 냄새를 맡지 못한다.', 'Smells so awful, it can cause fainting. Through degeneration of its nose, it lost its sense of smell.'),
  ('paldea', 196, 942, true, null, 'It always scowls in an attempt to make opponents take it seriously, but even crying children will burst into laughter when they see Maschiff’s face.'),
  ('paldea', 197, 943, true, null, 'This Pokémon can store energy in its large dewlap. Mabosstiff unleashes this energy all at once to blow away enemies.'),
  ('paldea', 198, 848, true, '독소를 화학 변화시켜 전기를 만들어 낸다. 전력은 약하지만 찌릿찌릿 마비된다.', 'It manipulates the chemical makeup of its poison to produce electricity. The voltage is weak, but it can cause a tingling paralysis.'),
  ('paldea', 199, 849, true, '호전적이며 성미가 급하다. 고인 물을 벌컥벌컥 마셔서 물속의 독소를 흡수한다.', 'This short-tempered and aggressive Pokémon chugs stagnant water to absorb any toxins it might contain.'),
  ('paldea', 199, 10343, false, '호전적이며 성미가 급하다. 고인 물을 벌컥벌컥 마셔서 물속의 독소를 흡수한다.', 'This short-tempered and aggressive Pokémon chugs stagnant water to absorb any toxins it might contain.'),
  ('paldea', 199, 10388, false, '호전적이며 성미가 급하다. 고인 물을 벌컥벌컥 마셔서 물속의 독소를 흡수한다.', 'This short-tempered and aggressive Pokémon chugs stagnant water to absorb any toxins it might contain.'),
  ('paldea', 199, 10397, false, '호전적이며 성미가 급하다. 고인 물을 벌컥벌컥 마셔서 물속의 독소를 흡수한다.', 'This short-tempered and aggressive Pokémon chugs stagnant water to absorb any toxins it might contain.'),
  ('paldea', 200, 702, true, '전기를 만들어내는 힘이 약해서 콘센트나 다른 전류포켓몬에게 훔친다.', 'Since Dedenne can’t generate much electricity on its own, it steals electricity from outlets or other electric Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 201, 417, true, '모인 전기를 나눠주려고 뺨의 주머니를 서로 비비는 파치리스가 발견되기도 한다.', 'A species related to the Pikachu line. Though Pachirisu is a calm Pokémon, it still presents a danger should one touch its electrified tail or cheeks.'),
  ('paldea', 202, 944, true, null, 'Though usually a mellow Pokémon, it will sink its sharp, poison-soaked front teeth into any that anger it, causing paralysis in the object of its ire.'),
  ('paldea', 203, 945, true, null, 'The color of the poisonous saliva depends on what the Pokémon eats. Grafaiai covers its fingers in its saliva and draws patterns on trees in forests.'),
  ('paldea', 204, 234, true, '멋지게 생긴 뿔은 미술품으로 비싸게 팔리기 때문에 멸종 직전까지 남획됐었던 포켓몬이다.', 'Its strangely shaped antlers have the power to bewitch those who see them. Medicine made by grinding up the black orbs from fallen antlers is an effective treatment for insomnia.'),
  ('paldea', 205, 590, true, '양손에서 내뿜는 포자는 맹독이지만 잘 말리면 복통약이 된다고 한다.', 'The spores released from this Pokémon’s hands are highly poisonous, but when thoroughly dried, the spores can be used as stomach medicine.'),
  ('paldea', 206, 591, true, '평상시에는 잘 움직이지 않는다. 떨어져 있는 몬스터볼 옆에서 그저 가만히 대기할 뿐이다.', 'Amoonguss generally doesn’t move much. It tends to stand still near Poké Balls that have been dropped on the ground.'),
  ('paldea', 207, 100, true, '몬스터볼과 닮은 것은 보호색으로 위장하기 위해서라고 전해지나 의외로 쉽게 자폭한다.', 'An enigmatic Pokémon that happens to bear a resemblance to a Poké Ball. When excited, it discharges the electric current it has stored in its belly, then lets out a great, uproarious laugh.'),
  ('paldea', 207, 10400, false, '몬스터볼과 닮은 것은 보호색으로 위장하기 위해서라고 전해지나 의외로 쉽게 자폭한다.', 'An enigmatic Pokémon that happens to bear a resemblance to a Poké Ball. When excited, it discharges the electric current it has stored in its belly, then lets out a great, uproarious laugh.'),
  ('paldea', 208, 101, true, '조금이라도 충격을 주면 체내에 있는 전기 에너지가 넘쳐서 폭발해버린다.', 'The tissue on the surface of its body is curiously similar in composition to an Apricorn. When irritated, this Pokémon lets loose an electric current equal to 20 lightning bolts.'),
  ('paldea', 208, 10401, false, '조금이라도 충격을 주면 체내에 있는 전기 에너지가 넘쳐서 폭발해버린다.', 'The tissue on the surface of its body is curiously similar in composition to an Apricorn. When irritated, this Pokémon lets loose an electric current equal to 20 lightning bolts.'),
  ('paldea', 209, 81, true, '전기를 먹으며 살아간다. 좌우의 유닛에서 전기자석파를 방사하며 하늘을 난다.', 'A bizarre Pokémon with but a single eye embedded in an iron sphere. I suspect this creature levitates due to the magnetism it emits from its arms, which resemble horseshoe-shaped magnets.'),
  ('paldea', 210, 82, true, '강한 자력을 끊임없이 발산한다. 레어코일이 접근하면 대부분의 컴퓨터에 이상 현상이 발생한다.', 'Three Magnemite gathered to evolve into this Pokémon. The source of much vexation on my part, as its powerful magnetism destroys my research equipment.'),
  ('paldea', 211, 462, true, '특수한 자기장의 영향으로 몸의 분자 구조가 변화해 진화했다고 여겨지고 있다.', 'I theorize that a special magnetic field influenced this Pokémon, changing its molecular structure and causing it to evolve. It emits strange radio waves toward space from its antenna.'),
  ('paldea', 212, 132, true, '메타몽끼리 만나게 되면 상대와 똑같은 모습이 되기 위해 평소보다 격렬하게 움직인다.', 'When it encounters another Ditto, it will move faster than normal to duplicate that opponent exactly.'),
  ('paldea', 213, 58, true, '충직한 성격으로 자신의 트레이너를 지키기 위해 필사적으로 상대방에게 짖어댄다.', 'They patrol their territory in pairs. I believe the igneous rock components in the fur of this species are the result of volcanic activity in its habitat.'),
  ('paldea', 213, 10398, false, '충직한 성격으로 자신의 트레이너를 지키기 위해 필사적으로 상대방에게 짖어댄다.', 'They patrol their territory in pairs. I believe the igneous rock components in the fur of this species are the result of volcanic activity in its habitat.'),
  ('paldea', 214, 59, true, '옛날부터 많은 사람의 마음을 사로잡은 아름다운 포켓몬이다. 마치 나는 것처럼 경쾌하게 달린다.', 'Snaps at its foes with fangs cloaked in blazing flame. Despite its bulk, it deftly feints every which way, leading opponents on a deceptively merry chase as it all but dances around them.'),
  ('paldea', 214, 10399, false, '옛날부터 많은 사람의 마음을 사로잡은 아름다운 포켓몬이다. 마치 나는 것처럼 경쾌하게 달린다.', 'Snaps at its foes with fangs cloaked in blazing flame. Despite its bulk, it deftly feints every which way, leading opponents on a deceptively merry chase as it all but dances around them.'),
  ('paldea', 215, 216, true, '꿀이 밴 손바닥을 핥고 있다. 깜지곰의 꿀은 과일과 독침붕이 모은 꽃가루가 혼합되어 만들어진다.', 'It licks its paws because of the sweet honey that has soaked into them. It is cunning, stealing into the nests of Combee and taking for itself the honey that the Combee have amassed.'),
  ('paldea', 216, 217, true, '숲 속에는 링곰이 먹이를 수집하는 큰 나무나 시냇가가 여기저기에 있다고 한다. 매일 먹이를 모으며 숲을 걷는다.', 'When the cold season arrives in Hisui, this Pokémon will wander fields and mountains alike in search of its favorite berries. Ursaring''s hunger during this time makes it a ferocious danger.'),
  ('paldea', 217, 335, true, '평소에는 4개의 다리로 행동하지만 화나면 뒷다리로 서서 앞발의 발톱을 내보인다. 세비퍼와는 선조 대대로 라이벌이다.', 'Zangoose usually stays on all fours, but when angered, it gets up on its hind legs and extends its claws. This Pokémon shares a bitter rivalry with Seviper that dates back over generations.'),
  ('paldea', 218, 336, true, '칼과 같은 꼬리는 적을 베어 가르는 동시에 스며 나온 맹독을 끼얹는다. 숙적인 쟝고와 계속하여 싸운다.', 'Seviper’s swordlike tail serves two purposes—it slashes foes and douses them with secreted poison. This Pokémon will not give up its long-running blood feud with Zangoose.'),
  ('paldea', 219, 333, true, '솜구름처럼 보이기 때문에 적의 눈에 잘 띄지 않는다. 세대를 거치면서 날개가 하얗게 되었다고 한다.', 'Since Swablu looks like a cumulus cloud, foes can have a hard time finding it. Apparently its wings turned white over many generations.'),
  ('paldea', 220, 334, true, '온순한 성질이지만 화나게 하면 날카로운 울음소리로 위협하며 가차 없이 공격한다.', 'This Pokémon has a kind disposition, but if it’s provoked, it will threaten opponents with shrill cries before attacking them without mercy.'),
  ('paldea', 220, 10169, false, '온순한 성질이지만 화나게 하면 날카로운 울음소리로 위협하며 가차 없이 공격한다.', 'This Pokémon has a kind disposition, but if it’s provoked, it will threaten opponents with shrill cries before attacking them without mercy.'),
  ('paldea', 221, 672, true, '물과 태양이 있으면 등에 있는 잎으로 에너지를 만들 수 있어서 먹이를 먹지 않아도 괜찮다.', 'If it has sunshine and water, it doesn’t need to eat, because it can generate energy from the leaves on its back.'),
  ('paldea', 222, 673, true, '산악 지대에서 생활한다. 뿔을 서로 부딪쳐서 힘을 겨루어 승자가 무리의 리더가 된다.', 'They inhabit mountainous regions. The leader of the herd is decided by a battle of clashing horns.'),
  ('paldea', 223, 128, true, '가라르에 서식하는 켄타로스는 기질이 거칠어서 사람이 등에 올라타는 것을 허용하지 않는다.', 'The Tauros of the Galar region are volatile in nature, and they won’t allow people to ride on their backs.'),
  ('paldea', 223, 10419, false, '가라르에 서식하는 켄타로스는 기질이 거칠어서 사람이 등에 올라타는 것을 허용하지 않는다.', 'The Tauros of the Galar region are volatile in nature, and they won’t allow people to ride on their backs.'),
  ('paldea', 223, 10420, false, '가라르에 서식하는 켄타로스는 기질이 거칠어서 사람이 등에 올라타는 것을 허용하지 않는다.', 'The Tauros of the Galar region are volatile in nature, and they won’t allow people to ride on their backs.'),
  ('paldea', 223, 10421, false, '가라르에 서식하는 켄타로스는 기질이 거칠어서 사람이 등에 올라타는 것을 허용하지 않는다.', 'The Tauros of the Galar region are volatile in nature, and they won’t allow people to ride on their backs.'),
  ('paldea', 224, 667, true, '혈기가 왕성하고 호기심도 왕성하다. 화가 나거나 싸움이 시작되면 짧은 갈기가 뜨거워진다.', 'This hot-blooded Pokémon is filled with curiosity. When it gets angry or starts fighting, its short mane gets hot.'),
  ('paldea', 225, 668, true, '섭씨 6000도의 숨결을 내뱉지만 먹이에는 사용하지 않는다. 고기는 날것을 좋아하기 때문이다.', 'The temperature of its breath is over 10,000 degrees Fahrenheit, but Pyroar doesn’t use it on its prey. This Pokémon prefers to eat raw meat.'),
  ('paldea', 226, 434, true, '꼬리를 들고 엉덩이를 돌리면 주의해야 한다. 기절할 정도로 악취 나는 분비액을 날릴 전조인 것이다.', 'The poison that gushes from its aft end is accompanied by an utterly evil-smelling odor with such potency that one whiff can induce memory loss.'),
  ('paldea', 227, 435, true, '꼬리 끝에서 날리는 분비액의 냄새는 강렬하다. 땅에 구멍을 파서 굴을 만든다.', 'Sprays a poisonous fluid to take down prey. Sometimes, unable to stomach the stench of its own fluid, it leaves the bested prey uneaten.'),
  ('paldea', 228, 570, true, '먹이를 찾아 사람으로 둔갑하여 마을에 나타나기도 한다. 주로 아이로 둔갑한다.', 'A once-departed soul, returned to life in Hisui. Derives power from resentment, which rises as energy atop its head and takes on the forms of foes. In this way, Zorua vents lingering malice.'),
  ('paldea', 228, 10407, false, '먹이를 찾아 사람으로 둔갑하여 마을에 나타나기도 한다. 주로 아이로 둔갑한다.', 'A once-departed soul, returned to life in Hisui. Derives power from resentment, which rises as energy atop its head and takes on the forms of foes. In this way, Zorua vents lingering malice.'),
  ('paldea', 229, 571, true, '고독한 트레이너는 조로아크에게 환상을 보여주도록 명령하여 혼자만의 외로움을 달랜다.', 'With its disheveled white fur, it looks like an embodiment of death. Heedless of its own safety, Zoroark attacks its nemeses with a bitter energy so intense, it lacerates Zoroark''s own body.'),
  ('paldea', 229, 10408, false, '고독한 트레이너는 조로아크에게 환상을 보여주도록 명령하여 혼자만의 외로움을 달랜다.', 'With its disheveled white fur, it looks like an embodiment of death. Heedless of its own safety, Zoroark attacks its nemeses with a bitter energy so intense, it lacerates Zoroark''s own body.'),
  ('paldea', 230, 215, true, '교활하고 사나운 성질을 가졌다. 부모가 없는 틈에 둥지로 침입해서 알을 훔친다.', 'Its sturdy, curved claws are ideal for traversing precipitous cliffs. From the tips of these claws drips a venom that infiltrates the nerves of any prey caught in Sneasel''s grasp.'),
  ('paldea', 230, 10404, false, '교활하고 사나운 성질을 가졌다. 부모가 없는 틈에 둥지로 침입해서 알을 훔친다.', 'Its sturdy, curved claws are ideal for traversing precipitous cliffs. From the tips of these claws drips a venom that infiltrates the nerves of any prey caught in Sneasel''s grasp.'),
  ('paldea', 231, 461, true, '발톱으로 사인을 그려 동료와 연락한다. 사인의 종류는 500가지가 넘는다고 한다.', 'This species corners prey as a pack, under the guidance of a leader. Weavile displays increased cunning, leading me to speculate that its evolution caused further brain development.'),
  ('paldea', 232, 198, true, '보스를 위해 반짝반짝 빛나는 것을 찾고 있다. 불길한 존재로 여겨 몹시 싫어하는 사람도 많다.', 'Widely shunned as a bearer of ill fortune. Upon crossing paths with this creature, I''ve been told one must chant ”Workrum, Workrum—bad luck, don''t come” as a protective incantation.'),
  ('paldea', 233, 430, true, '적과 싸우는 것은 거의 부하다. 자신의 손을 더럽히는 것은 상대에게 마지막 일격을 가할 때뿐이다.', 'One cry from this Pokémon, and a murder of Murkrow come flying. At such times, one would think the curtain of night had fallen, plunging the world into jet-black darkness.'),
  ('paldea', 234, 574, true, '아무도 없는데 나직이 운다. 고디탱에게만 보이는 뭔가와 이야기하는 듯하다.', 'Even when nobody seems to be around, Gothita can still be heard making a muted cry. Many believe it’s speaking to something only it can see.'),
  ('paldea', 235, 575, true, '별이 빛나는 밤에 가장 사이코 파워가 높아지는 듯하다. 우주와의 관계는 불명확하다.', 'On nights when the stars shine, this Pokémon’s psychic power is at its strongest. It’s unknown just what link Gothorita has to the greater universe.'),
  ('paldea', 236, 576, true, '고디모아젤을 통해 자신의 최후를 보게 된 악인은 그날을 마지막으로 종적을 감추었다.', 'A criminal who was shown his fate by a Gothitelle went missing that same day and was never seen again.'),
  ('paldea', 237, 854, true, '거처로 삼고 있는 찻잔은 유명한 골동품 식기다. 위작이 많이 나돌고 있다.', 'The teacup in which this Pokémon makes its home is a famous piece of antique tableware. Many forgeries are in circulation.'),
  ('paldea', 238, 855, true, '남겨진 홍차를 발견하면 자신의 몸을 흘러 들어가게 한다. 그 홍차는 포트데스가 된다.', 'Leaving leftover black tea unattended is asking for this Pokémon to come along and pour itself into it, turning the tea into a new Polteageist.'),
  ('paldea', 239, 778, true, '연구를 위해 누더기 속을 들여다본 학자가 알 수 없는 병으로 목숨을 잃었다.', 'There was a scientist who peeked under Mimikyu’s old rag in the name of research. The scientist died of a mysterious disease.'),
  ('paldea', 239, 10262, false, '연구를 위해 누더기 속을 들여다본 학자가 알 수 없는 병으로 목숨을 잃었다.', 'There was a scientist who peeked under Mimikyu’s old rag in the name of research. The scientist died of a mysterious disease.'),
  ('paldea', 240, 707, true, '머리끝으로 금속 이온을 흡수한다. 열쇠를 너무 좋아한 나머지 흉내를 내서 열쇠를 닮은 모습이 되었다고 한다.', 'Klefki sucks in metal ions with the horn topping its head. It seems this Pokémon loves keys so much that its head needed to look like one, too.'),
  ('paldea', 241, 876, true, '뿔로 가까이 있는 생명체의 기분을 읽는다. 긍정적인 감정이 힘의 원천이다.', 'Through its horns, it can pick up on the emotions of creatures around it. Positive emotions are the source of its strength.'),
  ('paldea', 241, 10355, false, '뿔로 가까이 있는 생명체의 기분을 읽는다. 긍정적인 감정이 힘의 원천이다.', 'Through its horns, it can pick up on the emotions of creatures around it. Positive emotions are the source of its strength.'),
  ('paldea', 242, 946, true, null, 'A soul unable to move on to the afterlife was blown around by the wind until it got tangled up with dried grass and became a Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 243, 947, true, null, 'It will open the branches of its head to envelop its prey. Once it absorbs all the life energy it needs, it expels the prey and discards it.'),
  ('paldea', 244, 948, true, null, 'Toedscool lives in muggy forests. The flaps that fall from its body are chewy and very delicious.'),
  ('paldea', 245, 949, true, null, 'These Pokémon gather into groups and form colonies deep within forests. They absolutely hate it when strangers approach.'),
  ('paldea', 246, 357, true, '목에 난 송이는 맛있어서 인기다. 따뜻한 장소에는 트로피우스를 키우는 목장이 많다.', 'Bunches of delicious fruit grow around its neck. In warm areas, many ranches raise Tropius.'),
  ('paldea', 247, 753, true, '낮에는 햇빛을 받으며 새근새근 잔다. 한밤중에 잠에서 깨어 활동을 시작한다.', 'During the day, Fomantis basks in sunlight and sleeps peacefully. It wakes and moves around at night.'),
  ('paldea', 248, 754, true, '양팔의 꽃잎은 얇고 예리하다. 빛을 모아 빔을 쏘기도 한다.', 'The petals on this Pokémon’s arms are thin and super sharp, and they can fire laser beams if Lurantis gathers light first.'),
  ('paldea', 249, 950, true, null, 'Klawf hangs upside-down from cliffs, waiting for prey. But Klawf can’t remain in this position for long because its blood rushes to its head.'),
  ('paldea', 250, 951, true, null, 'The more sunlight this Pokémon bathes in, the more spicy chemicals are produced by its body, and thus the spicier its moves become.'),
  ('paldea', 251, 952, true, null, 'The red head converts spicy chemicals into fire energy and blasts the surrounding area with a super spicy stream of flame.'),
  ('paldea', 252, 331, true, '비가 적은 척박한 환경일수록 아름답고 향기가 강한 꽃을 피운다. 가시가 달린 팔을 휘두르며 싸운다.', 'The more arid and harsh the environment, the more pretty and fragrant a flower Cacnea grows. This Pokémon battles by wildly swinging its thorny arms.'),
  ('paldea', 253, 332, true, '한밤중에 사막을 걷는 여행자의 뒤를 단체로 줄줄 달라붙어 걷는다. 지쳐 움직이지 못하게 되기를 기다리고 있다.', 'If a traveler is going through a desert in the thick of night, Cacturne will follow in a ragtag group. The Pokémon are biding their time, waiting for the traveler to tire and become incapable of moving.'),
  ('paldea', 254, 953, true, null, 'This Pokémon creates a mud ball by mixing sand and dirt with psychic energy. It treasures its mud ball more than its own life.'),
  ('paldea', 255, 954, true, null, 'The body that supports the ball barely moves. Therefore, it is thought that the true body of this Pokémon is actually inside the ball.'),
  ('paldea', 256, 48, true, '레이더 역할을 하는 큰 눈은 밝은 곳에서 보면 작은 눈이 모여서 이루어진 것임을 알 수 있다.', 'Its large eyes act as radar. In a bright place, you can see that they are clusters of many tiny eyes.'),
  ('paldea', 257, 49, true, '날개의 인분은 몸에 묻으면 좀처럼 떨어지지 않는다. 게다가 거기에서 독성분이 스며든다.', 'The powdery scales on its wings are hard to remove from skin. They also contain poison that leaks out on contact.'),
  ('paldea', 258, 204, true, '나무껍질을 타액으로 붙여서 몸을 두껍고 크게 만든다. 나이를 먹은 피콘은 엄청나게 크다.', 'It sticks tree bark to itself with its saliva, making itself thicker and larger. Elderly Pineco are ridiculously huge.'),
  ('paldea', 259, 205, true, '먹이를 삼키는 순간에는 껍질 안의 모습이 나타나지만 그 모습을 본 자는 아직 없다.', 'In the moment that it gulps down its prey, the inside of its shell is exposed, but to this day, no one has ever seen that sight.'),
  ('paldea', 260, 123, true, '숲속에서 많은 나무가 베인 채 쓰러져 있는 장소를 발견했다면 그곳은 스라크의 영역이다.', 'The large, wickedly sharp scythes on its forearms are truly fearsome weapons. Prey''s attempts to flee are unfailingly thwarted by this Pokémon''s nimble motions.'),
  ('paldea', 261, 212, true, '몸은 가늘지만 공격력은 무시무시하다. 몸의 근육도 금속으로 되어 있다.', 'Evolved by way of a curious item. The shell covering its body has been shown to be stronger than forged steel.'),
  ('paldea', 261, 10146, false, '몸은 가늘지만 공격력은 무시무시하다. 몸의 근육도 금속으로 되어 있다.', 'Evolved by way of a curious item. The shell covering its body has been shown to be stronger than forged steel.'),
  ('paldea', 262, 214, true, '자신 몸무게의 100배에 달하는 무게도 거뜬히 들어 올리는 괴력을 자랑하는 포켓몬이다.', 'This Pokémon has an unparalleled horn. Heracross itself demonstrates tremendous power—it''s capable of throwing several people trained in the traditional arts of war at once.'),
  ('paldea', 262, 10147, false, '자신 몸무게의 100배에 달하는 무게도 거뜬히 들어 올리는 괴력을 자랑하는 포켓몬이다.', 'This Pokémon has an unparalleled horn. Heracross itself demonstrates tremendous power—it''s capable of throwing several people trained in the traditional arts of war at once.'),
  ('paldea', 263, 955, true, null, 'Flittle’s toes levitate about half an inch above the ground because of the psychic power emitted from the frills on the Pokémon’s belly.'),
  ('paldea', 264, 956, true, null, 'It immobilizes opponents by bathing them in psychic power from its large eyes. Despite its appearance, it has a vicious temperament.'),
  ('paldea', 265, 449, true, '주로 낮에 활동한다. 사막의 밤은 기온이 낮아져 모래 깊숙이 들어가 잠을 잔다.', 'Though large and languid, Hippopotas is difficult to detect due to its tendency to burrow into and lurk beneath the soil. When agitated or excited, it expels sand from its nostrils.'),
  ('paldea', 266, 450, true, '화나게 하면 굉장히 흉포해진다. 들이마신 모래를 내뿜어 모래바람을 일으킨다.', 'Short-tempered and easily moved to violence. It whips up whirlwinds of sand to crush its foes'' spirits, then goes in for the attack.'),
  ('paldea', 267, 551, true, '작지만 하체의 힘은 세다. 모래를 헤치며 사막을 헤엄치듯 이동한다.', 'Sandile is small, but its legs and lower body are powerful. Pushing sand aside as it goes, Sandile moves through the desert as if it’s swimming.'),
  ('paldea', 268, 552, true, '어둠 속에서도 볼 수 있는 특수한 눈을 가졌지만 사막의 밤은 춥기 때문에 잘 움직이지 않는다.', 'Although this Pokémon has specialized eyes that allow it to see in the dark, Krokorok won’t move much at night—the desert gets cold after sunset.'),
  ('paldea', 269, 553, true, '난폭하지만 먹이를 잡기 위해 모래 속에서 며칠이든 기다리는 강한 인내력도 갖고 있다.', 'While terribly aggressive, Krookodile also has the patience to stay hidden under sand for days, lying in wait for prey.'),
  ('paldea', 270, 843, true, '콧구멍으로 모래를 분사한다. 적의 눈을 속이고 그 틈에 땅속으로 숨어들어 몸을 숨긴다.', 'It spews sand from its nostrils. While the enemy is blinded, it burrows into the ground to hide.'),
  ('paldea', 271, 844, true, '독특한 똬리 형태는 모래주머니의 모래를 더 효율적으로 분사하기 위함이다.', 'Its unique style of coiling allows it to blast sand out of its sand sac more efficiently.'),
  ('paldea', 271, 10387, false, '독특한 똬리 형태는 모래주머니의 모래를 더 효율적으로 분사하기 위함이다.', 'Its unique style of coiling allows it to blast sand out of its sand sac more efficiently.'),
  ('paldea', 272, 749, true, '흙을 먹어서 만든 진흙을 다리에 바르면 험한 길에서도 미끄러지지 않고 걸을 수 있게 된다.', 'It eats dirt to create mud and smears this mud all over its feet, giving them the grip needed to walk on rough terrain without slipping.'),
  ('paldea', 273, 750, true, '10톤이 넘는 짐을 끌고 자지도 쉬지도 않고 가라르지방을 종단할 수 있는 지구력이 있다.', 'Mudsdale has so much stamina that it could carry over 10 tons across the Galar region without rest or sleep.'),
  ('paldea', 274, 636, true, '전신이 제법 따뜻하다. 뿔 끝에서 불꽃을 뿜어 천적이나 먹이를 위협한다.', 'Larvesta’s body is warm all over. It spouts fire from the tips of its horns to intimidate predators and scare prey.'),
  ('paldea', 275, 637, true, '활활 타오르는 불의 고치에서 태어났다. 고대의 벽화에 불꽃의 신으로 그려져 있다.', 'This Pokémon emerges from a cocoon formed of raging flames. Ancient murals depict Volcarona as a deity of fire.'),
  ('paldea', 276, 371, true, '무리를 짓지 않고 혼자서 지낸다. 단단한 화석을 단 일격으로 두 동강 내버리는 돌머리를 가졌다.', 'Bagon is a solitary Pokémon that doesn’t form groups with others of its kind. It also has a head hard enough to cleave a boulder in one strike.'),
  ('paldea', 277, 372, true, '먹이를 먹지 않고 공복으로 버틴다. 모은 에너지를 다 사용하면 진화가 시작되는 듯하다.', 'Shelgon ignores its hunger entirely, never eating any food. Apparently, Shelgon will evolve once all its energy stores are used up.'),
  ('paldea', 278, 373, true, '넓은 하늘을 나는 기쁨에 크게 들떠 있지만 화나게 하면 손 쓸 수 없을 정도로 난폭하다.', 'While basking in the joy of flight generally keeps this Pokémon in high spirits, Salamence turns into an uncontrollable menace if something angers it.'),
  ('paldea', 278, 10191, false, '넓은 하늘을 나는 기쁨에 크게 들떠 있지만 화나게 하면 손 쓸 수 없을 정도로 난폭하다.', 'While basking in the joy of flight generally keeps this Pokémon in high spirits, Salamence turns into an uncontrollable menace if something angers it.'),
  ('paldea', 279, 957, true, null, 'It swings its handmade hammer around to protect itself, but the hammer is often stolen by Pokémon that eat metal.'),
  ('paldea', 280, 958, true, null, 'This Pokémon will attack groups of Pawniard and Bisharp, gathering metal from them in order to create a large and sturdy hammer.'),
  ('paldea', 281, 959, true, null, 'This intelligent Pokémon has a very daring disposition. It knocks rocks into the sky with its hammer, aiming for flying Corviknight.'),
  ('paldea', 282, 856, true, '인적이 드문 곳을 좋아한다. 강한 감정이 느껴지면 쏜살같이 도망쳐버린다.', 'If this Pokémon senses a strong emotion, it will run away as fast as it can. It prefers areas without people.'),
  ('paldea', 283, 857, true, '머리의 술로 상대를 때려 꼼짝 못 하게 한다. 프로복서조차 한 방에 KO되는 파괴력이다.', 'Using the braids on its head, it pummels foes to get them to quiet down. One blow from those braids would knock out a professional boxer.'),
  ('paldea', 284, 858, true, '숲의 마녀라는 별명을 가졌다. 소란을 피우면 촉수의 손톱에 찢겨질지도 모른다.', 'If you’re too loud around it, you risk being torn apart by the claws on its tentacle. This Pokémon is also known as the Forest Witch.'),
  ('paldea', 284, 10390, false, '숲의 마녀라는 별명을 가졌다. 소란을 피우면 촉수의 손톱에 찢겨질지도 모른다.', 'If you’re too loud around it, you risk being torn apart by the claws on its tentacle. This Pokémon is also known as the Forest Witch.'),
  ('paldea', 285, 859, true, '민가에 숨어들어 도둑질을 하고 속상해하는 사람의 마이너스 에너지도 얻는다.', 'It sneaks into people’s homes, stealing things and feasting on the negative energy of the frustrated occupants.'),
  ('paldea', 286, 860, true, '못된 꾀를 내어 밤에 숲으로 꾀어내려 한다. 농작물을 키우는 힘을 갖고 있는 듯하다.', 'With sly cunning, it tries to lure people into the woods. Some believe it to have the power to make crops grow.'),
  ('paldea', 287, 861, true, '머리카락은 근섬유의 역할을 하며 매듭이 풀어지면 촉수와 같은 움직임으로 상대를 묶어버린다.', 'Its hairs work like muscle fibers. When its hairs unfurl, they latch on to opponents, ensnaring them as tentacles would.'),
  ('paldea', 287, 10391, false, '머리카락은 근섬유의 역할을 하며 매듭이 풀어지면 촉수와 같은 움직임으로 상대를 묶어버린다.', 'Its hairs work like muscle fibers. When its hairs unfurl, they latch on to opponents, ensnaring them as tentacles would.'),
  ('paldea', 288, 960, true, null, 'This Pokémon can pick up the scent of a Veluza just over 65 feet away and will hide itself in the sand.'),
  ('paldea', 289, 961, true, null, 'It has a vicious temperament, contrary to what its appearance may suggest. It wraps its long bodies around prey, then drags the prey into its den.'),
  ('paldea', 290, 962, true, null, 'It gathers things up in an apron made from shed feathers added to the Pokémon’s chest feathers, then drops those things from high places for fun.'),
  ('paldea', 291, 963, true, null, 'It likes playing with others of its kind using the water ring on its tail. It uses ultrasonic waves to sense the emotions of other living creatures.'),
  ('paldea', 292, 964, true, null, 'This Pokémon changes its appearance if it hears its allies calling for help. Palafin will never show anybody its moment of transformation.'),
  ('paldea', 292, 10425, false, null, 'This Pokémon changes its appearance if it hears its allies calling for help. Palafin will never show anybody its moment of transformation.'),
  ('paldea', 293, 965, true, null, 'It is said that this Pokémon was born when an unknown poison Pokémon entered and inspirited an engine left at a scrap-processing factory.'),
  ('paldea', 294, 966, true, null, 'It creates a gas out of poison and minerals from rocks. It then detonates the gas in its cylinders—now numbering eight—to generate energy.'),
  ('paldea', 295, 967, true, null, 'Apparently Cyclizar has been allowing people to ride on its back since ancient times. Depictions of this have been found in 10,000-year-old murals.'),
  ('paldea', 296, 968, true, null, 'When attacked, this Pokémon will wield the tendrils on its body like fists and pelt the opponent with a storm of punches.'),
  ('paldea', 297, 302, true, '보석의 결정을 먹는다. 어둠 속에서는 두 눈이 보석의 빛을 낸다.', 'It feeds on gemstone crystals. In darkness, its eyes sparkle with the glitter of jewels.'),
  ('paldea', 297, 10168, false, '보석의 결정을 먹는다. 어둠 속에서는 두 눈이 보석의 빛을 낸다.', 'It feeds on gemstone crystals. In darkness, its eyes sparkle with the glitter of jewels.'),
  ('paldea', 298, 353, true, '해질녘에 어둠대신이 줄지어 있는 집과는 어울리지 말라는 오랜 속담이 남아 있다.', 'There’s a proverb that says, “Shun the house where Shuppet gather in the growing dusk.”'),
  ('paldea', 299, 354, true, '버려진 원념에 의해 태어난다. 소중히 대하면 만족해서 원래의 인형으로 돌아간다고 한다.', 'Resentment at being cast off made it spring into being. Some say that treating it well will satisfy it, and it will once more become a stuffed toy.'),
  ('paldea', 299, 10156, false, '버려진 원념에 의해 태어난다. 소중히 대하면 만족해서 원래의 인형으로 돌아간다고 한다.', 'Resentment at being cast off made it spring into being. Some say that treating it well will satisfy it, and it will once more become a stuffed toy.'),
  ('paldea', 300, 870, true, '6마리가 1마리의 포켓몬이다. 대열을 바꿔가며 팀워크로 싸운다.', 'The six of them work together as one Pokémon. Teamwork is also their battle strategy, and they constantly change their formation as they fight.'),
  ('paldea', 301, 701, true, '끝을 내는 결정적인 기술을 쓰기 전에 반드시 포즈를 취한다. 그 틈에 반격당하기도 한다.', 'It always strikes a pose before going for its finishing move. Sometimes opponents take advantage of that time to counterattack.'),
  ('paldea', 302, 442, true, '나쁜 짓만 일삼다가 신비한 술수를 사용하는 여행자에 의해 쐐기돌에 속박당했다.', 'It lays curses by thinking wicked thoughts. Writings tell that this Pokémon was born out of the assembly of five score and eight malevolent spirits.'),
  ('paldea', 303, 714, true, '온갖 주파수의 음파를 조종한다. 초음파를 맞으면 거대한 몸집의 포켓몬도 견디지 못한다.', 'No wavelength of sound is beyond Noibat’s ability to produce. The ultrasonic waves it generates can overcome much larger Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 304, 715, true, '어둠 속을 날아다니며 바위도 부수는 초음파로 타격을 입힌 뒤 예리한 이빨로 숨통을 끊는다.', 'Flying through the darkness, it weakens enemies with ultrasonic waves that could crush stone. Its fangs finish the fight.'),
  ('paldea', 305, 885, true, '1마리로는 아이에게도 질 정도로 힘이 약하지만 동료의 협력으로 단련하고 진화하면 강해진다.', 'If this weak Pokémon is by itself, a mere child could defeat it. But if Dreepy has friends to help it train, it can evolve and become much stronger.'),
  ('paldea', 306, 886, true, '보살피는 드라꼰을 머리에 태우지 않으면 진정하지 못하고 다른 포켓몬을 태우려고 한다.', 'Without a Dreepy to place on its head and care for, it gets so uneasy it’ll try to substitute any Pokémon it finds for the missing Dreepy.'),
  ('paldea', 307, 887, true, '뿔에 들어간 드라꼰은 마하의 속도로 날려지기를 기대하고 있는 것 같다.', 'Apparently the Dreepy inside Dragapult’s horns eagerly look forward to being launched out at Mach speeds.'),
  ('paldea', 308, 969, true, null, 'It absorbs nutrients from cave walls. The petals it wears are made of crystallized poison.'),
  ('paldea', 309, 970, true, null, 'When this Pokémon detects danger, it will open up its crystalline petals and fire beams from its conical body.'),
  ('paldea', 310, 479, true, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('paldea', 310, 10058, false, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('paldea', 310, 10059, false, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('paldea', 310, 10060, false, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('paldea', 310, 10061, false, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('paldea', 310, 10062, false, '플라스마로 된 몸으로 다양한 기계에 숨는다. 놀라게 하는 걸 매우 좋아한다.', 'This bizarre Pokémon appears to be a will-o''-the-wisp powered by electricity. Be wary, as Rotom is both smart and mischievous.'),
  ('paldea', 311, 971, true, null, 'It is said that a dog Pokémon that died in the wild without ever interacting with a human was reborn as this Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 312, 972, true, null, 'Houndstone spends most of its time sleeping in graveyards. Among all the dog Pokémon, this one is most loyal to its master.'),
  ('paldea', 313, 765, true, '숲 구석구석까지 파악하고 있어 상처 입은 포켓몬이 있으면 약초를 찾아 치료한다.', 'It knows the forest inside and out. If it comes across a wounded Pokémon, Oranguru will gather medicinal herbs to treat it.'),
  ('paldea', 314, 766, true, '20마리 정도가 무리 지어 생활한다. 정해진 역할을 해내면서 혹독한 자연에서 꿋꿋하게 살아남았다.', 'Passimian live in groups of about 20, with each member performing an assigned role. Through cooperation, the group survives.'),
  ('paldea', 315, 775, true, '죽을 때까지 계속 잠들어 있는 이유는 먹이인 잎사귀에 마취 성분이 포함되어 있기 때문이다.', 'It remains asleep from birth to death as a result of the sedative properties of the leaves that form its diet.'),
  ('paldea', 316, 246, true, '흙을 먹으며 살고 있다. 큰 산 하나를 다 먹으면 성장을 위해 잠자기 시작한다.', 'It feeds on soil. After it has eaten a large mountain, it will fall asleep so it can grow.'),
  ('paldea', 317, 247, true, '번데기지만 가만히 있지 않는다. 단단한 껍질 안에는 이미 팔다리가 만들어져 있다.', 'It will not stay still, even while it’s a pupa. It already has arms and legs under its solid shell.'),
  ('paldea', 318, 248, true, '지축을 울리면서 걸으면 큰 산조차 무너지며 주변의 지형은 변해버린다.', 'The quakes caused when it walks make even great mountains crumble and change the surrounding terrain.'),
  ('paldea', 318, 10149, false, '지축을 울리면서 걸으면 큰 산조차 무너지며 주변의 지형은 변해버린다.', 'The quakes caused when it walks make even great mountains crumble and change the surrounding terrain.'),
  ('paldea', 319, 874, true, '1년에 1번 정해진 일시에 어디선가 모여 둥글게 늘어서는 습성이 있다.', 'Once a year, on a specific date and at a specific time, they gather out of nowhere and form up in a circle.'),
  ('paldea', 320, 875, true, '더위에 약해서 얼굴을 언제나 얼음으로 식히고 있다. 머리의 털을 바다에 늘어뜨리고 먹이를 낚는다.', 'This Pokémon keeps its heat-sensitive head cool with ice. It fishes for its food, dangling its single hair into the sea to lure in prey.'),
  ('paldea', 320, 10354, false, '더위에 약해서 얼굴을 언제나 얼음으로 식히고 있다. 머리의 털을 바다에 늘어뜨리고 먹이를 낚는다.', 'This Pokémon keeps its heat-sensitive head cool with ice. It fishes for its food, dangling its single hair into the sea to lure in prey.'),
  ('paldea', 321, 871, true, '가시 하나하나에 전기를 비축하고 있다. 부러진 가시도 3시간 동안 방전을 계속한다.', 'It stores electricity in each spine. Even if one gets broken off, it still continues to emit electricity for at least three hours.'),
  ('paldea', 322, 769, true, '주로 모래사장에 산다. 입안에 손을 넣은 상대를 조종하여 자신을 크게 만든다.', 'Sandygast mainly inhabits beaches. It takes control of anyone who puts their hand into its mouth, forcing them to make its body bigger.'),
  ('paldea', 323, 770, true, '해변에 살지만 물을 싫어한다. 세찬 비를 맞으면 성의 형태를 유지하지 못한다.', 'This Pokémon lives on beaches, but it hates water. Palossand can’t maintain its castle-like shape if it gets drenched by a heavy rain.'),
  ('paldea', 324, 79, true, '꼬리를 물에 담가두면 단맛이 배어 나오기 때문에 이를 미끼로 포켓몬을 유인해서 낚는다.', 'When this Pokémon’s tail is soaked in water, sweetness seeps from it. Slowpoke uses this trait to lure in and fish up other Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 324, 10323, false, '꼬리를 물에 담가두면 단맛이 배어 나오기 때문에 이를 미끼로 포켓몬을 유인해서 낚는다.', 'When this Pokémon’s tail is soaked in water, sweetness seeps from it. Slowpoke uses this trait to lure in and fish up other Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 325, 80, true, '셀러에게 물린 충격으로 두 발로 걸을 수 있게 되었다. 셀러가 떨어지면 야돈으로 돌아간다고 한다.', 'Being bitten by a Shellder shocked this Pokémon into standing on two legs. If the Shellder lets go, it seems Slowbro will turn back into a Slowpoke.'),
  ('paldea', 325, 10173, false, '셀러에게 물린 충격으로 두 발로 걸을 수 있게 되었다. 셀러가 떨어지면 야돈으로 돌아간다고 한다.', 'Being bitten by a Shellder shocked this Pokémon into standing on two legs. If the Shellder lets go, it seems Slowbro will turn back into a Slowpoke.'),
  ('paldea', 325, 10324, false, '셀러에게 물린 충격으로 두 발로 걸을 수 있게 되었다. 셀러가 떨어지면 야돈으로 돌아간다고 한다.', 'Being bitten by a Shellder shocked this Pokémon into standing on two legs. If the Shellder lets go, it seems Slowbro will turn back into a Slowpoke.'),
  ('paldea', 326, 199, true, '아무리 어려운 문제를 물어봐도 모두 해결해주지만 그 누구도 야도킹의 말을 이해하지 못한다.', 'Slowking can solve any problem presented to it, but no one can understand a thing Slowking says.'),
  ('paldea', 326, 10331, false, '아무리 어려운 문제를 물어봐도 모두 해결해주지만 그 누구도 야도킹의 말을 이해하지 못한다.', 'Slowking can solve any problem presented to it, but no one can understand a thing Slowking says.'),
  ('paldea', 327, 422, true, '세게 만지면 보라색의 정체 모를 액체를 내보낸다. 해롭지는 않지만 끈적거린다.', 'Found in abundance on seashores bordering warm waters. Shellos are unexpectedly friendly and will crawl toward any person they see. Take care not to get coated in mucus!'),
  ('paldea', 327, 10039, false, '세게 만지면 보라색의 정체 모를 액체를 내보낸다. 해롭지는 않지만 끈적거린다.', 'Found in abundance on seashores bordering warm waters. Shellos are unexpectedly friendly and will crawl toward any person they see. Take care not to get coated in mucus!'),
  ('paldea', 328, 423, true, '흐물흐물한 몸이지만 제법 튼튼하다. 부드러워서 충격을 분산시킨다.', 'Eats beach sand for nourishment. Should one Gastrodon encounter another of a different color, a fierce battle will inevitably ensue.'),
  ('paldea', 328, 10040, false, '흐물흐물한 몸이지만 제법 튼튼하다. 부드러워서 충격을 분산시킨다.', 'Eats beach sand for nourishment. Should one Gastrodon encounter another of a different color, a fierce battle will inevitably ensue.'),
  ('paldea', 329, 90, true, '단단한 껍데기는 어떤 공격도 튕겨낸다. 껍데기를 열었을 때 안쪽을 공격당하는 것에는 약하다.', 'Its hard shell repels any kind of attack. It is vulnerable only when its shell is open.'),
  ('paldea', 330, 91, true, '한번 껍질을 닫아버리면 어떤 괴력의 소유자도 여는 것은 불가능하다.', 'Once it slams its shell shut, it is impossible to open, even by those with superior strength.'),
  ('paldea', 331, 211, true, '전신의 작은 바늘은 비늘이 변화한 것이다. 찔리면 독 때문에 정신을 잃게 된다.', 'Fishers detest this troublesome Pokémon because it sprays poison from its spines, getting it everywhere. A different form of Qwilfish lives in other regions.'),
  ('paldea', 331, 10403, false, '전신의 작은 바늘은 비늘이 변화한 것이다. 찔리면 독 때문에 정신을 잃게 된다.', 'Fishers detest this troublesome Pokémon because it sprays poison from its spines, getting it everywhere. A different form of Qwilfish lives in other regions.'),
  ('paldea', 332, 370, true, '따뜻한 바다의 산호초가 서식지다. 코산호의 가지 사이에서 자는 것을 특히 좋아한다.', 'Luvdisc makes its home in coral reefs in warm seas. It especially likes sleeping in the space between Corsola’s branches.'),
  ('paldea', 333, 456, true, '빛나는 꼬리지느러미로 먹이를 유인한다. 낮에는 해수면 가까이 있다가 밤이 되면 깊은 곳으로 이동한다.', 'What a gorgeous sight this Pokémon is as it swims with its long, pink-painted caudal fins fluttering behind it. Finneon''s beautiful appearance has led to its nickname: ”finery fish.”'),
  ('paldea', 334, 457, true, '심해 해저를 기어가듯 헤엄친다. 환상적인 지느러미의 빛은 밤하늘의 별과 같다.', 'Uses its gleaming fins to hunt its prey. The view of Lumineon schooling near the surface of the sea at night is breathtaking— it''s as though there were shining stars right there.'),
  ('paldea', 335, 779, true, '시마사리의 바늘도 뚫지 못할 정도로 두꺼운 피부를 가졌다. 튼튼한 이빨로 어적어적 바늘을 갉아서 먹는다.', 'Its skin is thick enough to fend off Mareanie’s spikes. With its robust teeth, Bruxish crunches up the spikes and eats them.'),
  ('paldea', 336, 594, true, '약해진 포켓몬을 도와주는 것은 이를 노리고 오는 포켓몬에게 자신도 공격받기 때문이라고 한다.', 'The reason it helps Pokémon in a weakened condition is that any Pokémon coming after them may also attack Alomomola.'),
  ('paldea', 337, 690, true, '썩은 해초를 닮아서 바다를 떠도는 해초 더미 안에 숨어 적의 눈을 속인다.', 'Skrelp looks like a piece of rotten seaweed, so it can blend in with seaweed drifting on the ocean and avoid being detected by enemies.'),
  ('paldea', 338, 691, true, '머리의 갓을 해면 위로 내밀고 태양 빛을 받아 드래곤 에너지를 만든다.', 'Dragalge generates dragon energy by sticking the plume on its head out above the ocean’s surface and bathing it in sunlight.'),
  ('paldea', 339, 692, true, '오른팔의 집게 안에 담긴 가스를 폭발시켜 탄환처럼 물을 발사해서 상대를 쓰러뜨린다.', 'By detonating gas that accumulates in its right claw, this Pokémon launches water like a bullet. This is how Clauncher defeats its enemies.'),
  ('paldea', 340, 693, true, '오른팔은 해수 포탄을 발사하는 대포다. 유조선을 가라앉게 할 정도의 위력이다.', 'Clawitzer’s right arm is a cannon that launches projectiles made of seawater. Shots from a Clawitzer’s cannon arm can sink a tanker.'),
  ('paldea', 341, 602, true, '약한 전기밖에 낼 수 없어 많은 저리어가 모여서 강력한 전기를 발산한다.', 'One alone can emit only a trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock.'),
  ('paldea', 342, 603, true, '식욕이 왕성한 포켓몬이다. 먹이를 발견하면 덮쳐서 전기로 마비시킨 후 먹는다.', 'These Pokémon have a big appetite. When they spot their prey, they attack it and paralyze it with electricity.'),
  ('paldea', 343, 604, true, '팔 힘으로 바다에서 기어 나와 물가에 있는 먹이를 덮친다. 한순간에 바다로 끌고 들어간다.', 'They crawl out of the ocean using their arms. They will attack prey on shore and immediately drag it into the ocean.'),
  ('paldea', 344, 747, true, '알로라지방의 시마사리와 달리 가라르의 시마사리는 코산호의 가지의 맛을 아직 모른다.', 'Unlike their Alolan counterparts, the Mareanie of the Galar region have not yet figured out that the branches of Corsola are delicious.'),
  ('paldea', 345, 748, true, '고래왕도 사흘 밤낮 괴로워할 정도의 맹독을 체내 독주머니에 듬뿍 비축하고 있다.', 'Within the poison sac in its body is a poison so toxic that Pokémon as large as Wailord will still be suffering three days after it first takes effect.'),
  ('paldea', 346, 973, true, null, 'This Pokémon apparently ties the base of its neck into a knot so that energy stored in its belly does not escape from its beak.'),
  ('paldea', 347, 147, true, '오랫동안 환상이라고 불렸다. 이마에 있는 작은 돌기는 성장하고 있는 뿔이다.', 'This Pokémon was long considered to be no more than a myth. The small lump on a Dratini’s forehead is actually a horn that’s still coming in.'),
  ('paldea', 348, 148, true, '꼬리의 구슬에 힘을 모아 날씨를 조종한다. 오라에 둘러싸인 모습은 신비롭다.', 'This Pokémon gathers power in the orbs on its tail and controls the weather. When enshrouded by an aura, Dragonair has a mystical appearance.'),
  ('paldea', 349, 149, true, '바다의 화신이라고 불린다. 망나뇽 형태의 조각상을 뱃머리에 두는 배도 많다.', 'This Pokémon is known as the Sea Incarnate. Figureheads that resemble Dragonite decorate the bows of many ships.'),
  ('paldea', 350, 872, true, '땅에 쌓인 눈을 먹는다. 많이 먹으면 먹을수록 등의 가시는 훌륭하게 자란다.', 'It eats snow that piles up on the ground. The more snow it eats, the bigger and more impressive the spikes on its back grow.'),
  ('paldea', 351, 873, true, '산과 들을 황폐하게 만들면 용서하지 않는다. 차가운 날개로 날아다니며 눈보라를 일으켜 응징한다.', 'It shows no mercy to any who desecrate fields and mountains. It will fly around on its icy wings, causing a blizzard to chase offenders away.'),
  ('paldea', 352, 459, true, '배에 열리는 아이스크림 같은 나무열매는 가라르에 사는 달막화들이 매우 좋아한다.', 'One is likely to encounter this Pokémon while out in the snow. There are stories of Snover appearing in human settlements but doing no harm—rather, they bond with the children.'),
  ('paldea', 353, 460, true, '블리자드를 일으키는 포켓몬이다. 커다란 몸을 흔들면 부근 일대는 금세 새하얗게 된다.', 'A powerful Pokémon that can split huge boulders with ease. Dislikes associating with others and chooses to live quietly deep within the mountains, playing with the snow.'),
  ('paldea', 353, 10160, false, '블리자드를 일으키는 포켓몬이다. 커다란 몸을 흔들면 부근 일대는 금세 새하얗게 된다.', 'A powerful Pokémon that can split huge boulders with ease. Dislikes associating with others and chooses to live quietly deep within the mountains, playing with the snow.'),
  ('paldea', 354, 225, true, '자신의 먹이를 사람이나 포켓몬에게 나눠주는 습성이 있어 언제나 먹이를 찾아다닌다.', 'It has a generous habit of sharing its food with people and Pokémon, so it’s always scrounging around for more food.'),
  ('paldea', 355, 613, true, '기술을 사용하기 전에 코를 훌쩍인다. 콧물에 포함된 강한 냉기가 얼음 기술의 근원이다.', 'It sniffles before performing a move, using its frosty snot to provide an icy element to any move that needs it.'),
  ('paldea', 356, 614, true, '차가운 바다에서 씩씩하게 헤엄친다. 지치면 한숨을 내쉬어 바다를 얼린 뒤 그 위에서 쉰다.', 'It swims energetically through frigid seas. When it gets tired, it freezes the seawater with its breath so it can rest on the ice.'),
  ('paldea', 357, 361, true, '추운 땅에서만 살 수 있다. 영하 100도의 환경에서도 건강하게 뛰어다닌다.', 'Arrives alongside the first snow. It''s thought that homes Snorunt visit will prosper for many generations. By tradition, one might offer a lump of ice made from pure water at one''s front door.'),
  ('paldea', 358, 362, true, '공기 중의 수분을 단숨에 얼게 하는 힘으로 먹이를 냉동시켜 버린다.', 'It covers its body with an armor of ice harder than steel. Uses its breath to freeze prey, which it then devours as if they were frozen desserts.'),
  ('paldea', 358, 10176, false, '공기 중의 수분을 단숨에 얼게 하는 힘으로 먹이를 냉동시켜 버린다.', 'It covers its body with an armor of ice harder than steel. Uses its breath to freeze prey, which it then devours as if they were frozen desserts.'),
  ('paldea', 359, 478, true, '마이너스 50도의 냉기를 뿜어 먹이를 얼린 뒤 거처로 가져가서 가지런히 나열한다.', 'A Pokémon inhabited by the soul of a woman who died bearing a grudge in the snowy mountains. Legends of Froslass placing deathly curses on misbehaving men send shivers down my spine.'),
  ('paldea', 360, 615, true, '뜨거워지면 수증기로 변한다. 여름철에 모습을 볼 일은 거의 없다.', 'When the weather gets hot, these Pokémon turn into water vapor. Cryogonal are almost never seen during summer.'),
  ('paldea', 361, 974, true, null, 'This species left the ocean and began living on land a very long time ago. It seems to be closely related to Wailmer.'),
  ('paldea', 362, 975, true, null, 'This Pokémon wanders around snowy, icy areas. It protects its body with powerful muscles and a thick layer of fat under its skin.'),
  ('paldea', 363, 712, true, '혹한의 지역에 서식한다. 크레베이스의 등에 자신의 발을 얼어붙게 해 고정한다.', 'Lives on mountains blanketed in perennial snow. It freezes water vapor in the air to make the ice helmet that it dons for defense.'),
  ('paldea', 364, 713, true, '낮 동안의 활동으로 몸의 균열이 깊어지지만 하룻밤 사이에 균열이 없는 몸으로 돌아간다.', 'The armor of ice covering its lower jaw puts steel to shame and can shatter rocks with ease. This Pokémon barrels along steep mountain paths, cleaving through the deep snow.'),
  ('paldea', 364, 10412, false, '낮 동안의 활동으로 몸의 균열이 깊어지지만 하룻밤 사이에 균열이 없는 몸으로 돌아간다.', 'The armor of ice covering its lower jaw puts steel to shame and can shatter rocks with ease. This Pokémon barrels along steep mountain paths, cleaving through the deep snow.'),
  ('paldea', 365, 627, true, '딱딱한 나무열매도 산산조각 내는 악력을 가졌다. 쉽게 다투고 아무에게나 승부를 건다.', 'Its chick-like looks belie its hotheadedness. It challenges its parents at every opportunity, desperate to prove its strength.'),
  ('paldea', 366, 628, true, '혈기왕성하고 거칠어서 가라르의 배달부 자리는 아머까오에게 뺏겼다.', 'Screaming a bloodcurdling battle cry, this huge and ferocious bird Pokémon goes out on the hunt. It blasts lakes with shock waves, then scoops up any prey that float to the water''s surface.'),
  ('paldea', 366, 10409, false, '혈기왕성하고 거칠어서 가라르의 배달부 자리는 아머까오에게 뺏겼다.', 'Screaming a bloodcurdling battle cry, this huge and ferocious bird Pokémon goes out on the hunt. It blasts lakes with shock waves, then scoops up any prey that float to the water''s surface.'),
  ('paldea', 367, 624, true, '절각참을 보스로 둔 무리를 만든다. 무리를 이끄는 날을 꿈꾸며 날마다 단련을 계속한다.', 'A pack of these Pokémon forms to serve a Bisharp boss. Each Pawniard trains diligently, dreaming of one day taking the lead.'),
  ('paldea', 368, 625, true, '칼날을 가는 돌의 장소를 두고 액슨도와 격렬하게 싸움을 벌인다.', 'Violent conflicts erupt between Bisharp and Fraxure over places where sharpening stones can be found.'),
  ('paldea', 369, 983, true, null, 'Only a Bisharp that stands above all others in its vast army can evolve into Kingambit.'),
  ('paldea', 370, 633, true, '눈이 보이지 않아 닥치는 대로 물면서 본인 주위의 상황을 파악한다.', 'Because it can’t see, this Pokémon is constantly biting at everything it touches, trying to keep track of its surroundings.'),
  ('paldea', 371, 634, true, '1개의 먹이를 2개의 머리가 서로 뺏는다. 누구랑 싸운 것도 아닌데 언제나 상처투성이다.', 'Their two heads will fight each other over a single piece of food. Zweilous are covered in scars even without battling others.'),
  ('paldea', 372, 635, true, '3개의 머리로 번갈아 가며 물어뜯는다. 상대가 쓰러질 때까지 공격을 멈추지 않는다.', 'The three heads take turns sinking their teeth into the opponent. Their attacks won’t slow until their target goes down.'),
  ('paldea', 373, 976, true, null, 'When Veluza discards unnecessary flesh, its mind becomes honed and its psychic power increases. The spare flesh has a mild but delicious flavor.'),
  ('paldea', 374, 977, true, null, 'This Pokémon is a glutton, but it’s bad at getting food. It teams up with a Tatsugiri to catch prey.'),
  ('paldea', 375, 978, true, null, 'This is a small dragon Pokémon. It lives inside the mouth of Dondozo to protect itself from enemies on the outside.'),
  ('paldea', 375, 10427, false, null, 'This is a small dragon Pokémon. It lives inside the mouth of Dondozo to protect itself from enemies on the outside.'),
  ('paldea', 375, 10428, false, null, 'This is a small dragon Pokémon. It lives inside the mouth of Dondozo to protect itself from enemies on the outside.'),
  ('paldea', 376, 984, true, null, 'Sightings of this Pokémon have occurred in recent years. The name Great Tusk was taken from a creature listed in a certain book.'),
  ('paldea', 377, 985, true, null, 'There has been only one reported sighting of this Pokémon. It resembles a mysterious creature depicted in an old expedition journal.'),
  ('paldea', 378, 986, true, null, 'It is possible that the creature listed as Brute Bonnet in a certain book could actually be this Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 379, 987, true, null, 'This Pokémon has characteristics similar to those of Flutter Mane, a creature mentioned in a certain book.'),
  ('paldea', 380, 988, true, null, 'This mysterious Pokémon has some similarities to a creature that an old book introduced as Slither Wing.'),
  ('paldea', 381, 989, true, null, 'No records exist of this Pokémon being caught. Data is lacking, but the Pokémon’s traits match up with a creature shown in an expedition journal.'),
  ('paldea', 382, 990, true, null, 'This Pokémon closely resembles a scientific weapon that a paranormal magazine claimed was sent to this planet by aliens.'),
  ('paldea', 383, 991, true, null, 'Its shape is similar to a robot featured in a paranormal magazine article. The robot was said to have been created by an ancient civilization.'),
  ('paldea', 384, 992, true, null, 'It is very similar to a cyborg covered exclusively by a paranormal magazine. The cyborg was said to be the modified form of a certain athlete.'),
  ('paldea', 385, 993, true, null, 'It resembles a certain Pokémon introduced in a paranormal magazine, described as the offspring of a Hydreigon that fell in love with a robot.'),
  ('paldea', 386, 994, true, null, 'This Pokémon resembles an unknown object described in a paranormal magazine as a UFO sent to observe humanity.'),
  ('paldea', 387, 995, true, null, 'It has some similarities to a Pokémon introduced in a dubious magazine as a Tyranitar from one billion years into the future.'),
  ('paldea', 388, 996, true, null, 'Frigibax absorbs heat through its dorsal fin and converts the heat into ice energy. The higher the temperature, the more energy Frigibax stores.'),
  ('paldea', 389, 997, true, null, 'Arctibax freezes the air around it, protecting its face with an ice mask and turning its dorsal fin into a blade of ice.'),
  ('paldea', 390, 998, true, null, 'This Pokémon blasts cryogenic air out from its mouth. This air can instantly freeze even liquid-hot lava.'),
  ('paldea', 391, 999, true, null, 'This Pokémon was born inside a treasure chest about 1,500 years ago. It sucks the life-force out of scoundrels who try to steal the treasure.'),
  ('paldea', 391, 10432, false, null, 'This Pokémon was born inside a treasure chest about 1,500 years ago. It sucks the life-force out of scoundrels who try to steal the treasure.'),
  ('paldea', 392, 1000, true, null, 'Its body seems to be made up of 1,000 coins. This Pokémon gets along well with others and is quick to make friends with anybody.'),
  ('paldea', 393, 1001, true, null, 'The grudge of a person punished for writing the king’s evil deeds upon wooden tablets has clad itself in dead leaves to become a Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 394, 1002, true, null, 'This Pokémon can control 100 tons of fallen snow. It plays around innocently by leaping in and out of avalanches it has caused.'),
  ('paldea', 395, 1003, true, null, 'The fear poured into an ancient ritual vessel has clad itself in rocks and dirt to become a Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 396, 1004, true, null, 'It controls flames burning at over 5,400 degrees Fahrenheit. It casually swims through the sea of lava it creates by melting rock and sand.'),
  ('paldea', 397, 1005, true, null, 'It is possible that this is the creature listed as Roaring Moon in an expedition journal that still holds many mysteries.'),
  ('paldea', 398, 1006, true, null, 'It has some similarities to a mad scientist’s invention covered in a paranormal magazine.'),
  ('paldea', 399, 1007, true, null, 'This seems to be the Winged King mentioned in an old expedition journal. It was said to have split the land with its bare fists.'),
  ('paldea', 400, 1008, true, null, 'Much remains unknown about this creature. It resembles Cyclizar, but it is far more ruthless and powerful.'),
  ('paldea', 401, 167, true, '이빨의 독은 그다지 강하진 않지만 둥지에 걸려서 움직일 수 없는 먹이를 약하게 만들기에는 충분하다.', 'Although the poison from its fangs isn’t that strong, it’s potent enough to weaken prey that gets caught in its web.'),
  ('paldea', 402, 168, true, '실을 뿜어서 먹이를 잡는다. 밤이 되면 둥지를 떠나 적극적으로 사냥에 나선다.', 'It spews threads from its mouth to catch its prey. When night falls, it leaves its web to go hunt aggressively.'),
  ('paldea', 403, 193, true, '눈알을 움직이지 않고 360도를 볼 수 있다. 급브레이크나 방향 전환이 특기다. 노린 먹이를 빠르게 몰아넣는다.', 'Its frail wings are so thin that one can see clear through them. However, during flight these wings exhibit the power to churn air with force enough to launch a house skyward.'),
  ('paldea', 404, 469, true, '6개의 다리로 어른을 껴안고도 너끈히 날 수 있다. 꼬리의 날개로 균형을 잡는다.', 'Extremely violent. When hunting, it wastes none of its energy, aiming only for prey''s most vulnerable spots. Any who manage to tame this Pokémon must be of incredible bravery.'),
  ('paldea', 405, 195, true, '몸은 항상 미끄럽다. 헤엄칠 때마다 강바닥에 머리를 부딪치지만 신경 쓰지 않는다.', 'Its body is always slimy. It often bangs its head on the river bottom as it swims but seems not to care.'),
  ('paldea', 406, 261, true, '무엇이든 먹는 잡식성인 포켓몬이다. 몸에 비해 큰 이빨이 특징이다. 꼬리의 털을 세우고 적을 위협한다.', 'Poochyena is an omnivore—it will eat anything. A distinguishing feature is how large its fangs are compared to its body. This Pokémon tries to intimidate its foes by making the hair on its tail bristle out.'),
  ('paldea', 407, 262, true, '그룹으로 행동하던 야생의 피가 남아 있어서 우수한 트레이너만을 리더로서 인정하고 명령을 따른다.', 'Mightyena travel and act as a pack in the wild. The memory of its life in the wild compels the Pokémon to obey only those Trainers that it recognizes to possess superior skill.'),
  ('paldea', 408, 313, true, '꼬리의 불빛을 사용하여 단체로 밤하늘에 기하학적인 도형을 그린다. 네오비트가 내는 달콤한 향기를 매우 좋아한다.', 'Volbeat’s tail glows like a lightbulb. With other Volbeat, it uses its tail to draw geometric shapes in the night sky. This Pokémon loves the sweet aroma given off by Illumise.'),
  ('paldea', 409, 314, true, '볼비트를 유도하여 사인을 그린다. 복잡한 사인을 그리는 네오비트일수록 동료에게 존경받는다고 전해진다.', 'Illumise leads a flight of illuminated Volbeat to draw signs in the night sky. This Pokémon is said to earn greater respect from its peers by composing more complex designs in the sky.'),
  ('paldea', 410, 341, true, '외국에서 온 포켓몬이 야생화했다. 아무리 더러운 강이라도 적응해버린다.', 'It was originally a Pokémon from afar that escaped to the wild. It can adapt to the dirtiest river.'),
  ('paldea', 411, 342, true, '싸움을 좋아하는 성격. 거처에 가까이 오는 상대를 가차 없이 때려눕힌다.', 'A brutish Pokémon that loves to battle. It will crash itself into any foe that approaches its nest.'),
  ('paldea', 412, 540, true, '잎사귀로 옷을 만들기 때문에 패션 디자이너에게 마스코트로 인기가 있다.', 'Since this Pokémon makes its own clothes out of leaves, it is a popular mascot for fashion designers.'),
  ('paldea', 413, 541, true, '잎사귀로 몸을 감싸 추위를 막는다. 가까이 있는 낙엽을 먹으며 숲을 이동한다.', 'It protects itself from the cold by wrapping up in leaves. It stays on the move, eating leaves in forests.'),
  ('paldea', 414, 542, true, '낙엽이 발효되는 열로 알을 따뜻하게 한다. 잎사귀로 두르보의 포대기를 만든다.', 'It keeps its eggs warm with heat from fermenting leaves. It also uses leaves to make warm wrappings for Sewaddle.'),
  ('paldea', 415, 742, true, '상대가 내뿜는 오라로 다음 행동을 예측한다. 공격을 가볍게 피하고 반격한다.', 'An opponent’s aura can tell Cutiefly what that opponent’s next move will be. Then Cutiefly can glide around the attack and strike back.'),
  ('paldea', 416, 743, true, '비에 젖는 것을 매우 싫어한다. 흐린 날이 많은 가라르지방에서는 모습을 좀처럼 보기 힘들다.', 'Ribombee absolutely hate getting wet or rained on. In the cloudy Galar region, they are very seldom seen.'),
  ('paldea', 417, 23, true, '성장할수록 점점 길어진다. 밤에는 나뭇가지에 몸을 돌돌 말고 쉰다.', 'The older it gets, the longer it grows. At night, it wraps its long body around tree branches to rest.'),
  ('paldea', 418, 24, true, '무서워 보이는 배의 무늬는 연구 결과 6종류 정도의 패턴이 확인되었다.', 'The frightening patterns on its belly have been studied. Six variations have been confirmed.'),
  ('paldea', 419, 69, true, '온도가 높고 습기가 있는 장소를 좋아한다. 덩굴을 사용해 작은 벌레를 잡아먹는다.', 'Prefers hot and humid places. It ensnares tiny bugs with its vines and devours them.'),
  ('paldea', 420, 70, true, '배가 고프면 움직이는 것을 닥치는 대로 삼킨 다음 용해액으로 마무리한다.', 'When hungry, it swallows anything that moves. Its hapless prey is dissolved by strong acids.'),
  ('paldea', 421, 71, true, '꿀 냄새로 먹이를 끌어들인다. 입안에 넣은 것은 하루 만에 뼈까지 녹여버린다고 한다.', 'Lures prey with the sweet aroma of honey. Swallowed whole, the prey is dissolved in a day, bones and all.'),
  ('paldea', 422, 161, true, '잠잘 때는 교대로 망을 본다. 위험을 탐지하면 동료를 깨운다. 무리에서 떨어지면 무서워서 자지 못한다.', 'When Sentret sleeps, it does so while another stands guard. The sentry wakes the others at the first sign of danger. When this Pokémon becomes separated from its pack, it becomes incapable of sleep due to fear.'),
  ('paldea', 423, 162, true, '적에게 습격당해도 좁은 틈으로 쑥 들어가서 도망갈 수 있다. 팔다리는 짧지만 매우 날쌔다.', 'Furret has a very slim build. When under attack, it can slickly squirm through narrow spaces and get away. In spite of its short limbs, this Pokémon is very nimble and fleet.'),
  ('paldea', 424, 1011, true, null, 'Dipplin is two creatures in one Pokémon. Its evolution was triggered by a special apple grown only in one place.'),
  ('paldea', 425, 37, true, '6개의 꼬리는 자라면서 털의 결이 좋아지며 아름다워진다. 안으면 살짝 따듯하다.', 'In its belly burns a fire, which Vulpix spits out in the form of fireballs. When young, this Pokémon has but one white tail. As the Pokémon matures, this single tail splits into six.'),
  ('paldea', 425, 10205, false, '6개의 꼬리는 자라면서 털의 결이 좋아지며 아름다워진다. 안으면 살짝 따듯하다.', 'In its belly burns a fire, which Vulpix spits out in the form of fireballs. When young, this Pokémon has but one white tail. As the Pokémon matures, this single tail splits into six.'),
  ('paldea', 426, 38, true, '머리가 좋고 집념이 강하다. 장난으로 꼬리를 잡으면 1000년 동안 화를 입는다고 한다.', 'The coat of gleaming golden fur is quite magnificent. This species is said to store sacred power in its nine long tails and to live for a millennium.'),
  ('paldea', 426, 10206, false, '머리가 좋고 집념이 강하다. 장난으로 꼬리를 잡으면 1000년 동안 화를 입는다고 한다.', 'The coat of gleaming golden fur is quite magnificent. This species is said to store sacred power in its nine long tails and to live for a millennium.'),
  ('paldea', 427, 60, true, '유속이 빠른 강에서는 두꺼운 입술을 흡반처럼 사용해 바위에 달라붙는다.', 'In rivers with fast-flowing water, this Pokémon will cling to a rock by using its thick lips, which act like a suction cup.'),
  ('paldea', 428, 61, true, '미끈미끈한 점액 형태의 땀을 흘린다. 적에게 붙잡혀도 스르륵 빠져나와 도망친다.', 'This Pokémon’s sweat is a slimy mucus. When captured, Poliwhirl can slither from its enemies’ grasp and escape.'),
  ('paldea', 429, 62, true, '헤엄뿐만 아니라 격투기도 특기다. 단련한 팔로 호쾌하게 펀치를 날린다.', 'Poliwrath is skilled at both swimming and martial arts. It uses its well-trained arms to dish out powerful punches.'),
  ('paldea', 430, 186, true, '수컷의 울음소리가 더 크다. 나지막하고 위협적인 목소리로 우는 왕구리가 암컷에게 인기다.', 'The cry of a male is louder than that of a female. Male Politoed with deep, menacing voices find more popularity with the opposite gender.'),
  ('paldea', 431, 163, true, '언제나 정해진 시간이 되면 울음소리를 내어 시계 대용으로 데리고 다니는 트레이너도 있다.', 'It begins to hoot at the same time every day. Some Trainers use them in place of clocks.'),
  ('paldea', 432, 164, true, '무언가를 생각하기 시작하면 목을 180도 회전시켜 두뇌 회전을 높인다.', 'When it needs to think, it rotates its head 180 degrees to sharpen its intellectual power.'),
  ('paldea', 433, 190, true, '나무 위에서 먹이를 찾는다. 좋아하는 달콤아를 발견하면 흥분해서 덤벼든다.', 'This treetop dweller possesses a tail as dexterous as a hand. Ancient writings describe this Pokémon as a one-armed oddity.'),
  ('paldea', 434, 424, true, '무엇을 하더라도 꼬리를 사용한다. 2개의 꼬리로 껴안는다면 정말로 친밀해졌다는 증거다.', 'To affirm their kinship, members of this species will form a ring by linking their newly doubled tails together. On rare occasions, humans have been accepted into such rings.'),
  ('paldea', 435, 220, true, '좋은 냄새를 맡으면 뒷일을 생각하지 않고 냄새 나는 방향으로 대시해버린다.', 'Swinub excels at sniffing out mushrooms buried beneath grass or snow. Since ancient times, the people of Hisui have often relied upon this skill.'),
  ('paldea', 436, 221, true, '4개의 다리는 짧지만 발굽이 넓고 거칠거칠하므로 눈 위도 미끄러지지 않고 걸을 수 있다.', 'The long fur of this Pokémon covers its eyes, ears, and even limbs, allowing Piloswine to resist harshly frigid conditions. The Pokémon''s white tusks can be used to defeat its enemies.'),
  ('paldea', 437, 473, true, '생긴 것처럼 힘이 장사다. 얼음으로 된 엄니는 추울수록 굵고 길어지면서 늠름해진다.', 'This species reached its zenith during the period known as the ice age. I suspect that Hisui''s frigid climate is in harmony with Mamoswine''s constitution, thus awakening hidden potential.'),
  ('paldea', 438, 273, true, '머리끝을 가지에 붙여 매달린다. 강풍이 불면 떨어지기도 한다.', 'It attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. Strong winds can sometimes make it fall.'),
  ('paldea', 439, 274, true, '잎새코가 부는 풀피리 소리는 듣는 이를 불안하게 만든다. 큰 나무의 비어 있는 구멍에 산다.', 'They live in holes bored in large trees. The sound of Nuzleaf’s grass flute fills listeners with dread.'),
  ('paldea', 440, 275, true, '숲속에서 조용히 지낸다. 큰 부채로 부치면 쌀쌀한 바람이 분다고 한다.', 'It lives quietly in the deep forest. It is said to create chilly winter winds with the fans it holds.'),
  ('paldea', 441, 708, true, '인간의 어린이를 닮은 목소리로 울어 어른을 숲속으로 유인하여 길을 잃게 한다.', 'With a voice like a human child’s, it cries out to lure adults deep into the forest, getting them lost among the trees.'),
  ('paldea', 442, 709, true, '발끝에서 가느다란 뿌리를 뻗고 숲의 나무들과 결속하여 자유자재로 조종하는 힘을 가졌다.', 'Small roots that extend from the tips of this Pokémon’s feet can tie into the trees of the forest and give Trevenant control over them.'),
  ('paldea', 443, 1012, true, null, 'Supposedly, the regrets of a tea ceremony master who died before perfecting his craft lingered in some matcha and became a Pokémon.'),
  ('paldea', 444, 1013, true, null, 'It pretends to be tea, trying to fool people into drinking it so it can drain their life-force. Its ruse is generally unsuccessful.'),
  ('paldea', 445, 74, true, '산길 등에 많이 서식한다. 실수로 밟으면 화를 내므로 주의가 필요하다.', 'Makes its home in mountainous regions, using its arms to climb along harsh mountain roads. Can be troublesome—carelessly kicking one will cause it to fly into a rage and chase after you.'),
  ('paldea', 445, 10211, false, '산길 등에 많이 서식한다. 실수로 밟으면 화를 내므로 주의가 필요하다.', 'Makes its home in mountainous regions, using its arms to climb along harsh mountain roads. Can be troublesome—carelessly kicking one will cause it to fly into a rage and chase after you.'),
  ('paldea', 446, 75, true, '산길에서 자주 굴러다닌다. 가는 길에 무엇이 있든 전혀 신경 쓰지 않는다.', 'Dwells in holes dug into sheer walls of stone. It enjoys rolling down slopes as though it were a boulder during a rockfall, so keep an eye upward while traversing mountain roads.'),
  ('paldea', 446, 10212, false, '산길에서 자주 굴러다닌다. 가는 길에 무엇이 있든 전혀 신경 쓰지 않는다.', 'Dwells in holes dug into sheer walls of stone. It enjoys rolling down slopes as though it were a boulder during a rockfall, so keep an eye upward while traversing mountain roads.'),
  ('paldea', 447, 76, true, '탈피한 직후에는 전체가 하얗고 부드럽지만 금방 공기와 접촉해서 단단해진다.', 'The rocklike shell is shed each year. The cast-off shell then crumbles, reverting to a mass of soil, which can be spread across fields to promote crop growth.'),
  ('paldea', 447, 10213, false, '탈피한 직후에는 전체가 하얗고 부드럽지만 금방 공기와 접촉해서 단단해진다.', 'The rocklike shell is shed each year. The cast-off shell then crumbles, reverting to a mass of soil, which can be spread across fields to promote crop growth.'),
  ('paldea', 448, 532, true, '자신의 3배 정도의 각목을 들 수 있게 된 으랏차는 머지않아 진화하게 된다.', 'Timburr that have started carrying logs that are about three times their size are nearly ready to evolve.'),
  ('paldea', 449, 533, true, '철골을 자유자재로 다룬다. 해체는 잘하지만 무언가를 조립하는 것은 서툴다.', 'Gurdurr excels at demolition—construction is not its forte. In any case, there’s skill in the way this Pokémon wields its metal beam.'),
  ('paldea', 450, 534, true, '정말 싸울 생각이면 콘크리트 기둥을 버리고 주먹 하나로 상대를 노리고 덤벼든다.', 'When going all out, this Pokémon throws aside its concrete pillars and leaps at opponents to pummel them with its fists.'),
  ('paldea', 451, 877, true, '아무리 먹어도 금방 배가 고프다. 전기로 구운 씨앗을 소중히 갖고 다닌다.', 'It carries electrically roasted seeds with it as if they’re precious treasures. No matter how much it eats, it always gets hungry again in short order.'),
  ('paldea', 451, 10356, false, '아무리 먹어도 금방 배가 고프다. 전기로 구운 씨앗을 소중히 갖고 다닌다.', 'It carries electrically roasted seeds with it as if they’re precious treasures. No matter how much it eats, it always gets hungry again in short order.'),
  ('paldea', 452, 446, true, '털 안에 먹이를 모은다. 신뢰하는 상대에게는 한 입 나눠주기도 한다.', 'Its robust stomach allows it to nonchalantly devour even rotted matter. It pays frequent visits to villages, seeking out food scraps intended for compost.'),
  ('paldea', 453, 143, true, '위장이 튼튼해서 곰팡이가 피거나 썩은 것을 먹어도 배탈이 나지 않는다.', 'This glutton appears in villages without warning and devours the entirety of their rice granaries—such occurrences have long been counted among the gravest of disasters.'),
  ('paldea', 453, 10375, false, '위장이 튼튼해서 곰팡이가 피거나 썩은 것을 먹어도 배탈이 나지 않는다.', 'This glutton appears in villages without warning and devours the entirety of their rice granaries—such occurrences have long been counted among the gravest of disasters.'),
  ('paldea', 454, 270, true, '잎사귀가 너무 커서 무거워졌기 때문에 물에 떠서 생활하게 되었다.', 'Its leaf grew too large for it to live on land. That is how it began to live floating in the water.'),
  ('paldea', 455, 271, true, '햇볕이 잘 드는 물가에 산다. 낮에는 수초로 된 침대에서 자고 해가 지면 활동하기 시작한다.', 'It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water grass by day and becomes active at night.'),
  ('paldea', 456, 272, true, '경쾌한 리듬에 맞춰 몸을 움직여서 파워를 증폭시키고 있다.', 'If it hears festive music, it begins moving in rhythm in order to amplify its power.'),
  ('paldea', 457, 299, true, '강력한 자력으로 먹이를 끌어당겨 움직이지 않고 사냥을 하지만 천적을 끌어당기는 일도 있다.', 'Once the people of Hisui discovered that its red nose always points north, they grew to rely on it greatly when traveling afar. The nose seems to work in a similar way to ancient compasses.'),
  ('paldea', 458, 476, true, '3개의 작은 유닛을 사용해서 먹이를 잡거나 적과 싸운다. 본체는 거의 명령할 뿐이다.', 'It is able to emit powerful magnetism, allowing it control over the iron sand that forms its luscious mustache. Using this iron sand, Probopass forms hard stones with which it smites its prey.'),
  ('paldea', 459, 736, true, '커다란 턱으로 숲에서 땅을 파고 굴을 만든다. 달콤한 수액을 매우 좋아한다.', 'It uses its big jaws to dig nests into the forest floor, and it loves to feed on sweet tree sap.'),
  ('paldea', 460, 737, true, '먹은 낙엽을 소화할 때 전기가 발생하는 구조로 되어 있다. 배의 전기 주머니에 충전된다.', 'Its digestive processes convert the leaves it eats into electricity. An electric sac in its belly stores the electricity for later use.'),
  ('paldea', 461, 738, true, '예비 배터리로서 전지충이를 안고 날면 높은 전력의 전자빔을 연사할 수 있다.', 'If it carries a Charjabug to use as a spare battery, a flying Vikavolt can rapidly fire high-powered beams of electricity.'),
  ('paldea', 462, 27, true, '땅을 파서 굴을 만든다. 땅속의 단단한 바위도 날카로운 발톱으로 부수며 파고들어 간다.', 'It burrows into the ground to create its nest. If hard stones impede its tunneling, it uses its sharp claws to shatter them and then carries on digging.'),
  ('paldea', 462, 10203, false, '땅을 파서 굴을 만든다. 땅속의 단단한 바위도 날카로운 발톱으로 부수며 파고들어 간다.', 'It burrows into the ground to create its nest. If hard stones impede its tunneling, it uses its sharp claws to shatter them and then carries on digging.'),
  ('paldea', 463, 28, true, '날카로운 발톱으로 찍으며 나무에 오른다. 아래에서 기다리는 모래두지들에게 나무열매를 떨어뜨려 나눠준다.', 'It climbs trees by hooking on with its sharp claws. Sandslash shares the berries it gathers, dropping them down to Sandshrew waiting below the tree.'),
  ('paldea', 463, 10204, false, '날카로운 발톱으로 찍으며 나무에 오른다. 아래에서 기다리는 모래두지들에게 나무열매를 떨어뜨려 나눠준다.', 'It climbs trees by hooking on with its sharp claws. Sandslash shares the berries it gathers, dropping them down to Sandshrew waiting below the tree.'),
  ('paldea', 464, 207, true, '소리 내지 않고 미끄러지듯 활공한다. 양손의 커다란 손톱과 발의 발톱으로 먹이의 얼굴에 달라붙어 독침을 찌른다.', 'Its tail is tipped by a thick, horrible stinger. To bring down prey, it will first obscure their vision by covering their faces with its body, and then it will use the stinger to inject them with venom.'),
  ('paldea', 465, 472, true, '날갯소리를 내지 않고 하늘을 난다. 긴 꼬리로 먹이를 잡아 송곳니로 급소를 공격한다.', 'It glides soundlessly on pitch-black wings and sinks sharp fangs into the throat of its prey. It takes on a look of satisfaction once it has entirely drained its prey of blood.'),
  ('paldea', 466, 629, true, '금방 크게 성장하므로 엉덩이의 해골은 둥지 안에서 대물림되어 계속 사용된다.', 'Vullaby grow quickly. Bones that have gotten too small for older Vullaby to wear often get passed down to younger ones in the nest.'),
  ('paldea', 467, 630, true, '주운 뼈로 몸을 장식한다. 몸에 두르는 뼈의 모양은 유행이 있는 듯하다.', 'They adorn themselves with bones. There seem to be fashion trends among them, as different bones come into and fall out of popularity.'),
  ('paldea', 468, 782, true, '털이 금속처럼 단단해져서 생긴 비늘을 부딪쳐서 소리를 내고 동료와 소통한다.', 'Jangmo-o strikes its scales to communicate with others of its kind. Its scales are actually fur that’s become as hard as metal.'),
  ('paldea', 469, 783, true, '비늘을 부딪쳐 우렁찬 소리를 낸 후 상대에게 덤벼들어 날카로운 손톱으로 갈기갈기 찢는다.', 'Before attacking its enemies, it clashes its scales together and roars. Its sharp claws shred the opposition.'),
  ('paldea', 470, 784, true, '짜랑고우거의 비늘로 만든 갑옷을 두른 고대의 전사가 유적에 그려져 있다.', 'Certain ruins have paintings of ancient warriors wearing armor made of Kommo-o scales.'),
  ('paldea', 471, 109, true, '오염된 공기를 좋아한다. 옛날 가라르지방에는 지금보다 많은 또가스가 있었다고 한다.', 'It adores polluted air. Some claim that Koffing used to be more plentiful in the Galar region than they are now.'),
  ('paldea', 472, 110, true, '가라르의 또도가스보다 공기를 흡입하는 힘은 조금 약하지만 내뿜는 독소는 강력하다.', 'It can’t suck in air quite as well as a Galarian Weezing, but the toxins it creates are more potent than those of its counterpart.'),
  ('paldea', 472, 10326, false, '가라르의 또도가스보다 공기를 흡입하는 힘은 조금 약하지만 내뿜는 독소는 강력하다.', 'It can’t suck in air quite as well as a Galarian Weezing, but the toxins it creates are more potent than those of its counterpart.'),
  ('paldea', 473, 619, true, '작아도 기질은 거칠다. 방심하고 다가간 상대에게 화려한 연타를 먹인다.', 'Though small, Mienfoo’s temperament is fierce. Any creature that approaches Mienfoo carelessly will be greeted with a flurry of graceful attacks.'),
  ('paldea', 474, 620, true, '눈에 보이지 않을 정도의 스피드로 구사하는 발차기는 거대한 바위도 산산이 조각낸다.', 'Delivered at blinding speeds, kicks from this Pokémon can shatter massive boulders into tiny pieces.'),
  ('paldea', 475, 355, true, '모습을 투명하게 하고 몰래 먹잇감에 다가간다. 두꺼운 벽을 통과하는 능력을 지녔다.', 'I''ve heard that the children of Hisui all begin to behave once they''ve been told the story of how this Pokémon roams about before the witching hour to spirit away misbehaving children.'),
  ('paldea', 476, 356, true, '떠도는 사람의 영혼을 찾아 텅 빈 체내로 빨아들인다. 그 후 영혼이 어떻게 되는지는 알 수 없다.', 'There are rumors that peeking inside its bandage-wrapped body will cause one to get pulled in through the gaps between the bandages, never to return. I''ve been too scared to verify.'),
  ('paldea', 477, 477, true, '노린 상대를 배의 입으로 통째로 삼킨다. 영혼만 먹은 뒤 육체는 뱉어내고 떠난다.', 'Comes to those whose lives have come to an end and escorts their souls to the afterlife. Known to mistakenly take the souls of those who yet have life left in them, albeit rarely.'),
  ('paldea', 478, 433, true, '뛰어오르면 입안에 있는 구슬이 사방에 반사되어 방울 같은 음색을 만들어 낸다.', 'This Pokémon gave me an excruciating headache when it seemingly cried out without making a sound. Perhaps there are some sounds that the human ear is simply incapable of hearing.'),
  ('paldea', 479, 358, true, '바람이 강해지면 나뭇가지나 처마 끝에 머리의 흡반으로 매달려 울기 시작한다. 긴 꼬리로 나무열매를 집어서 먹는다.', 'Can emit waves of air powerful enough to knock out prey taller than itself. I hypothesize that it amplifies the faint sound of wind within its body.'),
  ('paldea', 480, 218, true, '몸 안에는 혈액 대신 필요한 영양과 산소를 운반하기 위해 작열하는 마그마가 순환되고 있다.', 'Slugma does not have any blood in its body. Instead, intensely hot magma circulates throughout this Pokémon’s body, carrying essential nutrients and oxygen to its organs.'),
  ('paldea', 481, 219, true, '체온이 약 1만 도나 돼서 빗방울이 몸에 닿으면 수증기가 자욱하게 피어나 주변이 깊은 안개에 둘러싸인다고 한다.', 'Magcargo’s body temperature is approximately 18,000 degrees Fahrenheit. Water is vaporized on contact. If this Pokémon is caught in the rain, the raindrops instantly turn into steam, cloaking the area in a thick fog.'),
  ('paldea', 482, 607, true, '흡수하는 생명이 젊으면 젊을수록 머리의 불꽃은 크고 괴이하게 타오른다.', 'The younger the life this Pokémon absorbs, the brighter and eerier the flame on its head burns.'),
  ('paldea', 483, 608, true, '램프인 척 마을 안으로 숨어든다. 죽음이 다가온 사람을 발견하면 조용히 뒤를 쫓는다.', 'It lurks in cities, pretending to be a lamp. Once it finds someone whose death is near, it will trail quietly after them.'),
  ('paldea', 484, 609, true, '샹델라를 등불 대용으로 사용했던 저택에서는 장례식이 끊이지 않았다고 한다.', 'In homes illuminated by Chandelure instead of lights, funerals were a constant occurrence— or so it’s said.'),
  ('paldea', 485, 173, true, '실루엣이 별 모양이다. 그 때문에 별똥별을 타고 온다고 여겨진다.', 'In silhouette, they resemble twinkling starlight. When shooting stars rain from the night sky, Cleffa gather in numbers and dance as though they are indeed incarnations of the stars.'),
  ('paldea', 486, 35, true, '애교 있는 몸동작과 울음소리로 귀엽다고 많은 인기를 누리는 포켓몬. 그러나 좀처럼 눈에 띄지 않는다.', 'It can be found in quiet mountain areas on a full moon''s night. Its dancing and its tiny, faintly glowing wings confer upon it a lovely fairylike quality.'),
  ('paldea', 487, 36, true, '1km 앞에 떨어진 바늘 소리가 들릴 정도로 귀가 좋아 평소에는 조용한 곳에서 지낸다.', 'Legend says that on clear, quiet nights, it listens for the voices of its kin living on the moon. I, too, often think of my homeland, so far away.'),
  ('paldea', 488, 349, true, '볼품없고 못생긴 포켓몬이지만 강인한 생명력을 가져 약간의 물만 있어도 살아남는다.', 'It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.'),
  ('paldea', 489, 350, true, '밀로틱의 아름다운 모습을 본 자는 황폐해진 마음이 치유된다고 한다.', 'It’s said that a glimpse of a Milotic and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you’re feeling.'),
  ('paldea', 490, 703, true, '세상 어딘가에는 멜리시가 많이 잠들어 있는 광맥이 있고 무리의 여왕도 있다고 한다.', 'It’s said that somewhere in the world, there’s a mineral vein housing a large pack of slumbering Carbink. It’s also said that this pack has a queen.'),
  ('paldea', 491, 580, true, '나는 것보다 헤엄치는 것이 특기로 수중에 잠수해서는 제일 좋아하는 물이끼를 기쁘게 먹는다.', 'They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater.'),
  ('paldea', 492, 581, true, '새벽이 오면 스완나들이 춤추기 시작한다. 한가운데에서 춤추는 스완나가 무리의 우두머리다.', 'Swanna start to dance at dusk. The one dancing in the middle is the leader of the flock.'),
  ('paldea', 493, 845, true, '먹보이다. 먹이인 찌로꼬치를 통째로 삼키지만 가끔 실수로 다른 포켓몬을 먹어버린다.', 'This hungry Pokémon swallows Arrokuda whole. Occasionally, it makes a mistake and tries to swallow a Pokémon other than its preferred prey.'),
  ('paldea', 493, 10341, false, '먹보이다. 먹이인 찌로꼬치를 통째로 삼키지만 가끔 실수로 다른 포켓몬을 먹어버린다.', 'This hungry Pokémon swallows Arrokuda whole. Occasionally, it makes a mistake and tries to swallow a Pokémon other than its preferred prey.'),
  ('paldea', 493, 10342, false, '먹보이다. 먹이인 찌로꼬치를 통째로 삼키지만 가끔 실수로 다른 포켓몬을 먹어버린다.', 'This hungry Pokémon swallows Arrokuda whole. Occasionally, it makes a mistake and tries to swallow a Pokémon other than its preferred prey.'),
  ('paldea', 494, 902, true, null, 'Clads itself in the souls of comrades that perished before fulfilling their goals of journeying upstream. No other species throughout all Hisui''s rivers is Basculegion''s equal.'),
  ('paldea', 494, 10417, false, null, 'Clads itself in the souls of comrades that perished before fulfilling their goals of journeying upstream. No other species throughout all Hisui''s rivers is Basculegion''s equal.'),
  ('paldea', 495, 901, true, null, 'I believe it was Hisui''s swampy terrain that gave Ursaluna its burly physique and newfound capacity to manipulate peat at will.'),
  ('paldea', 495, 10441, false, null, 'I believe it was Hisui''s swampy terrain that gave Ursaluna its burly physique and newfound capacity to manipulate peat at will.'),
  ('paldea', 496, 1014, true, null, 'After all its muscles were stimulated by the toxic chain around its neck, Okidogi transformed and gained a powerful physique.'),
  ('paldea', 497, 1015, true, null, 'The chain is made from toxins that enhance capabilities. It stimulated Munkidori''s brain and caused the Pokémon''s psychic powers to bloom.'),
  ('paldea', 498, 1016, true, null, 'Fezandipiti owes its beautiful looks and lovely voice to the toxic stimulants emanating from the chain wrapped around its body.'),
  ('paldea', 499, 1017, true, null, 'This Pokémon''s type changes based on which mask it''s wearing. It confounds its enemies with nimble movements and kicks.'),
  ('paldea', 499, 10442, false, null, 'This Pokémon''s type changes based on which mask it''s wearing. It confounds its enemies with nimble movements and kicks.'),
  ('paldea', 499, 10443, false, null, 'This Pokémon''s type changes based on which mask it''s wearing. It confounds its enemies with nimble movements and kicks.'),
  ('paldea', 499, 10444, false, null, 'This Pokémon''s type changes based on which mask it''s wearing. It confounds its enemies with nimble movements and kicks.'),
  ('paldea', 500, 84, true, '날개가 짧아서 하늘을 나는 것은 서투르지만 대신 발달한 다리로 빠르게 달릴 수 있다.', 'Its short wings make flying difficult. Instead, this Pokémon runs at high speed on developed legs.'),
  ('paldea', 501, 85, true, '두두의 머리 중 한 쪽이 분열한 변종. 초원을 시속 60km로 달린다.', 'One of Doduo’s two heads splits to form a unique species. It runs close to 40 mph in prairies.'),
  ('paldea', 502, 102, true, '6마리가 아니면 진정하지 못한다. 1마리라도 없어지면 바로 도망태세가 된다.', 'These Pokémon get nervous when they’re not in a group of six. The minute even one member of the group goes missing, Exeggcute become cowardly.'),
  ('paldea', 503, 103, true, '3개의 머리가 똘똘 뭉쳐서 쏘는 사이코 파워는 강력하다. 날씨가 흐리면 움직임이 둔하다.', 'When they work together, Exeggutor’s three heads can put out powerful psychic energy. Cloudy days make this Pokémon sluggish.'),
  ('paldea', 503, 10216, false, '3개의 머리가 똘똘 뭉쳐서 쏘는 사이코 파워는 강력하다. 날씨가 흐리면 움직임이 둔하다.', 'When they work together, Exeggutor’s three heads can put out powerful psychic energy. Cloudy days make this Pokémon sluggish.'),
  ('paldea', 504, 111, true, '한 가지만 기억할 수 있다. 돌진하기 시작하면 이유가 무엇이었든 금방 잊어버린다.', 'Ludicrously strong—when it butts heads with a mountain, it is the mountain that shatters. But its short legs struggle with turns, and it is incapable of stopping unless it collides with something.'),
  ('paldea', 505, 112, true, '전신을 갑옷 같은 피부로 보호하고 있다. 2000도의 마그마 속에서도 살 수 있다.', 'Rapidly rotates its horn to bore through bedrock. It swaggers around volcanic regions, protected from the lava''s heat by its tough, armorlike hide.'),
  ('paldea', 506, 464, true, '프로텍터로 공격을 튕겨내고 상대가 풀이 죽으면 특징적인 드릴로 관통한다.', 'This Pokémon evolved through use of a curious item. Its rocklike hide is composed of a mysterious substance and can withstand a blow from a masterwork sword with nary a scratch.'),
  ('paldea', 507, 239, true, '아직 전기를 모으는 게 서툴다. 전기를 먹기 위해 민가에 숨어들어 콘센트를 찾는다.', 'They generate electricity by spinning their arms. During a thunderstorm, if one hears the lively voices of children out in the wilderness, what one is actually hearing are the voices of Elekid.'),
  ('paldea', 508, 125, true, '폭풍이 치면 높은 나무 주위에 모여 번개가 떨어지기를 가만히 기다린다.', 'Feeds on electrical energy. During sudden showers beneath looming thunderclouds, one can observe Electabuzz scaling tall trees, where the Pokémon will then wait for lightning to strike.'),
  ('paldea', 509, 466, true, '발전량은 전기포켓몬 중에서도 손꼽히는 수준이다. 꼬리 끝에서 고압 전류를 방전한다.', 'Its evolution was induced by an unusual item, and its electrical output rises along with its heart rate. From its tails, it can unleash an electric current measuring 20,000 volts.'),
  ('paldea', 510, 240, true, '화산 주위에 살고 있다. 하루를 마칠 때에는 마그마에 잠겨 피로를 푼다.', 'This Pokémon lives in volcanic areas. With each breath, sparks spurt from its mouth and nose. When Magby is in good health, its flames gain a yellow tint.'),
  ('paldea', 511, 126, true, '온몸이 늘 불타고 있다. 화재를 일으키는 원인 중 하나로 두려움의 대상이 되고 있다.', 'Legend has it that this Pokémon was born from the crater of a volcano. When wounded, it bathes in lava to heal its body, much as one would soak in a hot spring.'),
  ('paldea', 512, 467, true, '화산의 화구에서 사는 동안 마그마 덩어리 모양의 기관을 가진 화산 같은 몸이 되었다.', 'Use of a strange item caused this Pokémon to evolve. Fireballs launched from the ends of its tubelike arms are hot enough to melt an iron pot in an instant.'),
  ('paldea', 513, 900, true, null, 'A violent creature that fells towering trees with its crude axes and shields itself with hard stone. If one should chance upon this Pokémon in the wilds, one''s only recourse is to flee.'),
  ('paldea', 514, 522, true, '방전하면 갈기가 빛난다. 갈기가 빛나는 횟수나 리듬으로 동료와 대화한다.', 'Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate.'),
  ('paldea', 515, 523, true, '천둥번개 같은 순발력을 가지고 있다. 제브라이카가 전속력으로 달리면 천둥소리가 울려 퍼진다.', 'They have lightning-like movements. When Zebstrika run at full speed, the sound of thunder reverberates.'),
  ('paldea', 516, 235, true, '꼬리 끝에서 나오는 체액으로 마크를 그린다. 마크에 따라서는 마니아에게 비싼 값에 거래된다.', 'It draws symbols with the fluid that oozes from the tip of its tail. Depending on the symbol, Smeargle fanatics will pay big money for them.'),
  ('paldea', 517, 868, true, '마빌크가 모습을 보인 디저트 가게는 크게 번창한다고 전해지고 있다.', 'They say that any patisserie visited by Milcery is guaranteed success and good fortune.'),
  ('paldea', 518, 869, true, '손에서 나오는 크림은 마휘핑이 행복할 때 단맛과 감칠맛이 깊어진다.', 'When Alcremie is content, the cream it secretes from its hands becomes sweeter and richer.'),
